{"mynerd_version": "2.5", "package_type": "workflow", "name": "뉴스 → 이야기 영상 (서식형) v3", "summary": "뉴스 한 건을 장면 이야기 영상(MP4)으로 만듭니다. 문구 쓰기, 나레이션, 영상 굽기, 배경음, 표지까지 전부 이 컴퓨터 안에서 끝납니다.\n\n[쓰는 법]\n실행하면 입력 서식이 뜹니다. 전부 비워도 돌아갑니다(AI 뉴스 자동 수집, 영어, 세로형, 9장면, 60초).\n- 뉴스 직접 입력: 첫 줄이 제목, 나머지가 본문. 회사 소식, 제품 안내 등 아무 글이나 됩니다.\n- 언어(en/ko), 모양(tall 세로형 / square 정사각형), 장면 수(3~12), 목표 길이(초)\n- 나레이션(on/off): 끄면 자막만 나오고 목표 길이가 정확히 지켜집니다. 켜면 말을 자르지 않고 말 길이에 장면을 맞추며, 끝나면 목표와 실제 길이 차이를 알려줍니다.\n- 강조색, 마지막 안내 문구(주소 등)도 바꿀 수 있습니다.\n완성본은 문서\\MYNERD\\images\\cardnews\\story\\완성본 폴더에 이름 붙어 담깁니다.\n\n[필요한 것]\n- ffmpeg (영상 굽기)\n- Supertonic 3 음성 모델 (나레이션 — 없거나 끄면 자막만)\n- gemma4:26b (문구 쓰기)\n- 인터넷 연결 (뉴스 자동 수집·배경 사진)\n\n[표기]\n나레이션 음성: Supertonic (OpenRAIL-M 라이선스, 상업 사용 가능·출처 표기 의무 준수)\n\n[고지]\n이 꾸러미에는 실행 코드(스킬 스크립트)가 들어 있으며 MYNERD 공식 제공자 서명이 붙어 있습니다. 설치 시 실행 고지에 동의해야 설치됩니다.", "has_code": true, "required_assets": [{"id": "gemma4:26b", "kind": "model"}], "content": {"mode": "expert", "graph": {"edges": [{"from": "in1", "to": "pick"}, {"from": "pick", "to": "brief"}, {"from": "brief", "to": "write_story"}, {"from": "write_story", "to": "prep_story"}, {"from": "prep_story", "to": "narrate"}, {"from": "narrate", "to": "feed_timed"}, {"from": "feed_timed", "to": "bake"}, {"from": "bake", "to": "mix"}, {"from": "mix", "to": "finish"}, {"from": "finish", "to": "report"}, {"from": "report", "to": "out1"}], "entry_node": "in1", "nodes": [{"id": "in1", "label": "시작(서식 값)", "type": "input"}, {"code": "# MN_STORY_PICK_V1 - 서식 값을 갈무리하고 뉴스를 고른다. news 칸이 차 있으면 그 글을 쓴다.\nimport json, os, time, urllib.request, urllib.parse\n\nUA = \"Mozilla/5.0 (compatible; MynerdCard/1.0)\"\nBASE = os.path.join(os.environ.get(\"LOCALAPPDATA\", \".\"), \"mynerd\")\nSEEN = os.path.join(BASE, \"newscard_seen.json\")\nJOB = os.path.join(BASE, \"storycard_job.json\")\nFORM = os.path.join(BASE, \"storycard_form.json\")\nDAYS = 21\nCUT = int(time.time()) - DAYS * 86400\n\nTOPIC = [\"local llm\", \"on-device\", \"open weights\", \"ai agent\",\n         \"small language model\", \"inference\", \"quantization\", \"offline ai\"]\n\nCOLOR = [\n    ([\"outage\", \"fail\", \"breach\", \"shutdown\", \"deprecat\", \"risk\", \"lawsuit\"], \"coral\"),\n    ([\"privacy\", \"security\", \"regulat\", \"compliance\", \"gdpr\", \"audit\"], \"teal\"),\n    ([\"gpu\", \"chip\", \"npu\", \"speed\", \"faster\", \"benchmark\", \"hardware\"], \"orange\"),\n    ([\"local\", \"on-device\", \"offline\", \"ship\", \"release\", \"launch\"], \"lime\"),\n    ([\"model\", \"weights\", \"paper\", \"research\", \"open-source\", \"train\"], \"violet\"),\n]\n\nos.makedirs(BASE, exist_ok=True)\n\nraw = \"\"\ntry:\n    raw = open(\"input.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\").read().strip()\nexcept Exception:\n    pass\n\nform = {}\nif raw.startswith(\"{\"):\n    try:\n        form = json.loads(raw)\n    except Exception:\n        form = {}\ntry:\n    with open(FORM, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        json.dump(form, f, ensure_ascii=False)\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(\"[오류] 서식 값을 저장하지 못했습니다: \" + repr(e))\n\n\ndef pal_of(text):\n    low = text.lower()\n    for words, name in COLOR:\n        if any(w in low for w in words):\n            return name\n    return \"lime\"\n\n\ndef emit(top):\n    try:\n        with open(JOB, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            json.dump(top, f, ensure_ascii=False)\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(\"[오류] 고른 뉴스를 저장하지 못했습니다: \" + repr(e))\n    print(\"TITLE: \" + top[\"title\"])\n    print(\"SOURCE: \" + top[\"src\"])\n    if top.get(\"body\"):\n        print(\"BODY: \" + \" \".join(top[\"body\"].split())[:1200])\n\n\nnews_text = str(form.get(\"news\") or \"\").strip()\nif news_text:\n    lines = news_text.splitlines()\n    top = {\"key\": \"manual:\" + str(int(time.time())),\n           \"title\": lines[0].strip()[:160],\n           \"url\": \"\", \"score\": 0, \"src\": \"DIRECT INPUT\",\n           \"body\": \" \".join(\" \".join(lines[1:]).split())[:1200],\n           \"palette\": pal_of(news_text), \"issue\": time.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\")}\n    print(\"직접 입력한 글로 만듭니다.\")\n    emit(top)\nelse:\n    def fetch(u, timeout=25):\n        q = urllib.request.Request(u, headers={\"User-Agent\": UA, \"Accept\": \"application/json\"})\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(q, timeout=timeout) as r:\n            return r.read().decode(\"utf-8\", \"replace\")\n\n    def load(p, d):\n        try:\n            with open(p, encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n                return json.load(f)\n        except Exception:\n            return d\n\n    seen = load(SEEN, {})\n    if not isinstance(seen, dict):\n        seen = {}\n\n    hn = []\n    hf = []\n    errs = []\n    for q in TOPIC:\n        try:\n            u = (\"https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/search?tags=story&query=\"\n                 + urllib.parse.quote(q)\n                 + \"&numericFilters=points>=25,created_at_i>\" + str(CUT)\n                 + \"&hitsPerPage=20\")\n            d = json.loads(fetch(u))\n            for h in d.get(\"hits\", []):\n                oid = h.get(\"objectID\") or \"\"\n                ttl = (h.get(\"title\") or \"\").strip()\n                if not oid or not ttl:\n                    continue\n                hn.append({\"key\": \"hn:\" + oid, \"title\": ttl,\n                           \"url\": h.get(\"url\") or (\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=\" + oid),\n                           \"score\": int(h.get(\"points\") or 0), \"src\": \"HACKER NEWS\",\n                           \"body\": (h.get(\"story_text\") or \"\")[:400]})\n            time.sleep(1)\n        except Exception as e:\n            errs.append(\"hn %s: %s\" % (q, e))\n\n    try:\n        d = json.loads(fetch(\"https://huggingface.co/api/models?sort=trendingScore&direction=-1&limit=20\"))\n        for m in d:\n            mid = m.get(\"id\") or \"\"\n            if not mid:\n                continue\n            tag = (m.get(\"pipeline_tag\") or \"\").strip()\n            hf.append({\"key\": \"hf:\" + mid, \"title\": mid + \" tops the Hugging Face trending list\",\n                       \"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/\" + mid,\n                       \"score\": int(m.get(\"likes\") or 0), \"src\": \"HUGGING FACE\",\n                       \"body\": \"open model, task: \" + (tag or \"unspecified\")\n                               + \", downloads: \" + str(m.get(\"downloads\") or 0)})\n    except Exception as e:\n        errs.append(\"hf: %s\" % e)\n\n    fresh = [c for c in hn if c[\"key\"] not in seen]\n    fresh.sort(key=lambda x: -x[\"score\"])\n    if not fresh:\n        fresh = [c for c in hf if c[\"key\"] not in seen]\n        fresh.sort(key=lambda x: -x[\"score\"])\n\n    if not fresh:\n        print(\"[없음] 새 뉴스가 없습니다. 이번에는 만들지 않습니다.\")\n        if errs:\n            print(\"못 가져온 곳: \" + \" | \".join(errs[:4]))\n    else:\n        top = fresh[0]\n        top[\"palette\"] = pal_of(top[\"title\"] + \" \" + top[\"body\"])\n        top[\"issue\"] = time.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\")\n        print(\"후보 %d건 중 한 건을 골랐습니다.\" % len(fresh))\n        emit(top)\n", "id": "pick", "label": "서식 갈무리 + 뉴스 고르기", "timeout": 180, "type": "code"}, {"code": "# MN_STORY_BRIEF_V1 - 장면 수와 목표 길이로 장면당 나레이션 분량을 셈해 지시문을 만든다\nimport os, json\n\nBASE = os.path.join(os.environ.get(\"LOCALAPPDATA\", \".\"), \"mynerd\")\nFORM = os.path.join(BASE, \"storycard_form.json\")\n\nraw = open(\"input.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\").read().strip()\n\ntry:\n    form = json.load(open(FORM, encoding=\"utf-8\"))\nexcept Exception:\n    form = {}\n\nif not raw or raw.startswith(\"[없음]\") or raw.startswith(\"[오류]\"):\n    print(\"none\")\nelse:\n    try:\n        n = int(form.get(\"scene_count\") or 9)\n    except Exception:\n        n = 9\n    n = max(3, min(12, n))\n    try:\n        target = float(form.get(\"target_seconds\") or 60)\n    except Exception:\n        target = 60.0\n    target = max(15.0, min(180.0, target))\n    lang = str(form.get(\"lang\") or \"en\").strip().lower()\n    if lang not in (\"en\", \"ko\"):\n        lang = \"en\"\n    per = target / n\n    speak = max(1.5, per - 0.9)\n    if lang == \"ko\":\n        budget = \"narration per scene: at most %d Korean characters\" % int(speak * 5)\n    else:\n        budget = \"narration per scene: at most %d words\" % int(speak * 2.3)\n    print(\"SCENES: %d\" % n)\n    print(\"LANG: \" + lang)\n    print(\"BUDGET: \" + budget)\n    print(\"ARTICLE:\")\n    print(raw)\n", "id": "brief", "label": "쓰기 지시문 조립", "timeout": 60, "type": "code"}, {"engine": "gemma4:26b", "id": "write_story", "label": "이야기 문구 쓰기", "system_prompt": "You write a short news story video script as ONE JSON object. Output ONLY the JSON. No markdown fences, no comments, no text before or after the JSON.\n\nThe input gives you: SCENES (how many scenes), LANG (en or ko), BUDGET (narration length limit per scene), and ARTICLE (the news to tell).\n\nJSON shape:\n{\"title\": \"topic in 2 to 4 words\", \"scenes\": [ exactly SCENES items ]}\n\nScene items, in order:\n- First scene must be: {\"type\":\"cover\",\"kicker\":\"WORD\",\"kicker2\":\"WORD\",\"headline1\":\"...\",\"headline2\":\"...\",\"standfirst\":\"one line\",\"photo_query\":\"two english words\",\"narration\":\"...\"}\n- Last scene must be: {\"type\":\"outro\",\"label\":\"...\",\"headline1\":\"...\",\"lines\":[\"...\",\"...\"],\"photo_query\":\"...\",\"narration\":\"...\"}\n- Middle scenes mix these three types:\n  {\"type\":\"text\",\"label\":\"...\",\"headline1\":\"...\",\"lines\":[\"...\",\"...\"],\"photo_query\":\"...\",\"narration\":\"...\"}\n  {\"type\":\"number\",\"label\":\"...\",\"big\":\"75\",\"lines\":[\"...\",\"...\"],\"photo_query\":\"...\",\"narration\":\"...\"}\n  {\"type\":\"quote\",\"label\":\"...\",\"text\":\"one sentence\",\"photo_query\":\"...\",\"narration\":\"...\"}\n  Use at least one number scene if the article contains a number.\n\nRules:\n- Write every visible text and every narration in LANG.\n- Length limits when LANG is en: kicker and kicker2 one word max 11 characters uppercase; headline1 and headline2 max 14 characters each; standfirst max 58 characters; each item of lines max 34 characters; big max 4 characters.\n- Length limits when LANG is ko: kicker and kicker2 max 6 characters; headline1 and headline2 max 8 characters each; standfirst max 34 characters; each item of lines max 22 characters; big max 4 characters. Korean letters are wide, breaking the limit breaks the picture.\n- narration: plain spoken sentences, factual, within BUDGET. No headline repetition word for word.\n- photo_query: two or three concrete English words, objects or places only, never names or logos, always English even when LANG is ko.\n- Never exaggerate. Do not invent numbers. Only state what the ARTICLE says.\nIf the input is exactly the word none, output exactly: none", "type": "agent", "user_prompt_template": "{{input}}", "linked_agent_id": 287, "agent_id": 287}, {"code": "# MN_STORY_PREP_V1 - 문구 JSON 을 검사하고 서식 값(색·모양·길이·목소리·전환)을 얹는다\nimport os, json, time, sqlite3\n\nBASE = os.path.join(os.environ.get(\"LOCALAPPDATA\", \".\"), \"mynerd\")\nFORM = os.path.join(BASE, \"storycard_form.json\")\nJOB = os.path.join(BASE, \"storycard_job.json\")\n\nraw = open(\"input.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\").read().strip()\n\n\ndef load(p):\n    try:\n        return json.load(open(p, encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n    except Exception:\n        return {}\n\n\ndef unq(v):\n    v = (\"\" if v is None else str(v)).strip()\n    if len(v) >= 2 and v[0] == v[-1] and v[0] in ('\"', \"'\"):\n        v = v[1:-1]\n    return v.replace(\"\\\\\\\\\", \"\\\\\").strip()\n\n\ndef out_root():\n    try:\n        con = sqlite3.connect(\"C:\\\\Mynerd\\\\config.db\")\n        r = con.execute(\"SELECT value FROM config WHERE key=?\", (\"SYSTEM.out_root\",)).fetchone()\n        con.close()\n        if r and str(r[0]).strip():\n            return unq(r[0])\n    except Exception:\n        pass\n    return os.path.join(os.path.expanduser(\"~\"), \"Documents\", \"MYNERD\")\n\n\ndef skip(why):\n    print(json.dumps({\"skip\": True, \"skip_reason\": why}, ensure_ascii=False))\n\n\nif not raw or raw.lower() == \"none\" or raw.startswith(\"[없음]\"):\n    skip(\"이번에는 만들 뉴스가 없습니다.\")\nelse:\n    t = raw\n    if t.startswith(\"```\"):\n        t = t.split(\"\\n\", 1)[1] if \"\\n\" in t else t\n        if t.rstrip().endswith(\"```\"):\n            t = t.rstrip()[:-3]\n    i = t.find(\"{\")\n    j = t.rfind(\"}\")\n    if i < 0 or j < i:\n        skip(\"문구가 JSON 이 아닙니다. 받은 첫 200자: \" + raw[:200])\n    else:\n        story = None\n        try:\n            story = json.loads(t[i:j + 1])\n        except Exception as e:\n            skip(\"문구 JSON 을 읽지 못했습니다: \" + repr(e) + \" / 받은 첫 200자: \" + raw[:200])\n        if story is not None:\n            scenes = story.get(\"scenes\") or []\n            form = load(FORM)\n            job = load(JOB)\n            try:\n                n = int(form.get(\"scene_count\") or 9)\n            except Exception:\n                n = 9\n            n = max(3, min(12, n))\n            if not scenes:\n                skip(\"장면이 없습니다.\")\n            elif len(scenes) < max(3, n - 2):\n                skip(\"장면이 %d개뿐입니다(요청 %d개). 문구를 다시 받아야 합니다.\" % (len(scenes), n))\n            else:\n                if len(scenes) > n:\n                    scenes = scenes[:n]\n                try:\n                    target = float(form.get(\"target_seconds\") or 60)\n                except Exception:\n                    target = 60.0\n                target = max(15.0, min(180.0, target))\n                per = round(target / len(scenes), 2)\n                lang = str(form.get(\"lang\") or \"en\").strip().lower()\n                if lang not in (\"en\", \"ko\"):\n                    lang = \"en\"\n                narr_on = str(form.get(\"narration\") or \"on\").strip().lower() not in (\"off\", \"0\", \"false\", \"no\", \"끔\")\n                for sc in scenes:\n                    if not sc.get(\"type\"):\n                        sc[\"type\"] = \"text\"\n                    if not narr_on and \"narration\" in sc:\n                        del sc[\"narration\"]\n                cta = str(form.get(\"cta\") or \"\").strip()\n                if cta and scenes[-1].get(\"type\") == \"outro\":\n                    scenes[-1][\"cta\"] = cta\n                outjob = {\n                    \"title\": str(story.get(\"title\") or job.get(\"title\") or \"카드뉴스\")[:40],\n                    \"palette\": str(form.get(\"color\") or job.get(\"palette\") or \"lime\"),\n                    \"shape\": str(form.get(\"shape\") or \"tall\"),\n                    \"seed\": abs(hash(str(job.get(\"key\") or time.time()))) % 97,\n                    \"fps\": 20,\n                    \"scene_seconds\": per,\n                    \"target_seconds\": target,\n                    \"lang\": lang,\n                    \"voice\": str(form.get(\"voice\") or \"F1\"),\n                    \"voice_lang\": lang,\n                    \"source\": (\"출처 \" if lang == \"ko\" else \"VIA \") + str(job.get(\"src\") or \"\"),\n                    \"out\": os.path.join(out_root(), \"images\", \"cardnews\", \"story\"),\n                    \"transition\": str(form.get(\"transition\") or \"\"),\n                    \"style_image\": str(form.get(\"style_image\") or \"\"),\n                    \"logo\": str(form.get(\"logo\") or \"\"),\n                    \"brand\": str(form.get(\"brand\") or \"\"),\n                    \"scenes\": scenes,\n                }\n                print(json.dumps(outjob, ensure_ascii=False))\n", "id": "prep_story", "label": "서식 값 얹어 검사", "timeout": 60, "type": "code"}, {"code": "", "id": "narrate", "label": "나레이션 굽기", "skill_script": {"folder": "뉴스 카드 만들기", "path": "scripts/narrate.py"}, "timeout": 900, "type": "code"}, {"code": "# MN_STORY_FEED_V1 - 길이를 맞춘 작업 서식을 찾아 내용째로 굽기 칸에 넘긴다\nimport os, json, glob, sqlite3\n\nraw = open(\"input.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\").read()\n\nif \"만들 뉴스가 없습니다\" in raw or '\"skip\"' in raw:\n    print(raw.strip()[:400])\nelse:\n    def unq(v):\n        v = (\"\" if v is None else str(v)).strip()\n        if len(v) >= 2 and v[0] == v[-1] and v[0] in ('\"', \"'\"):\n            v = v[1:-1]\n        return v.replace(\"\\\\\\\\\", \"\\\\\").strip()\n\n    def out_root():\n        try:\n            con = sqlite3.connect(\"C:\\\\Mynerd\\\\config.db\")\n            r = con.execute(\"SELECT value FROM config WHERE key=?\", (\"SYSTEM.out_root\",)).fetchone()\n            con.close()\n            if r and str(r[0]).strip():\n                return unq(r[0])\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n        return os.path.join(os.path.expanduser(\"~\"), \"Documents\", \"MYNERD\")\n\n    STORY = os.path.join(out_root(), \"images\", \"cardnews\", \"story\")\n\n    path = \"\"\n    for ln in raw.splitlines():\n        if \": \" in ln:\n            cand = ln.split(\": \", 1)[1].strip()\n            if cand.lower().endswith(\"_job_timed.json\") and os.path.isfile(cand):\n                path = cand\n                break\n    if not path:\n        cands = []\n        for pat in (os.path.join(STORY, \"_job*.json\"), os.path.join(STORY, \"*\", \"_job*.json\")):\n            cands.extend(glob.glob(pat))\n        cands = [p for p in cands if os.path.isfile(p)]\n        if cands:\n            path = max(cands, key=os.path.getmtime)\n    if not path:\n        print(\"[오류] 구울 작업 서식을 찾지 못했습니다.\")\n    else:\n        txt = open(path, encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\").read()\n        json.loads(txt)\n        print(txt)\n", "id": "feed_timed", "label": "길이 맞춘 서식 넘기기", "timeout": 60, "type": "code"}, {"code": "", "id": "bake", "label": "영상 굽기", "skill_script": {"folder": "뉴스 카드 만들기", "path": "scripts/story.py"}, "timeout": 900, "type": "code"}, {"code": "", "id": "mix", "label": "소리 합치기", "skill_script": {"folder": "뉴스 카드 만들기", "path": "scripts/mix.py"}, "timeout": 300, "type": "code"}, {"code": "", "id": "finish", "label": "완성본 담기", "skill_script": {"folder": "뉴스 카드 만들기", "path": "scripts/cleanup.py"}, "timeout": 120, "type": "code"}, {"code": "# MN_STORY_REPORT_V1 - 결과와 목표 대비 실제 길이를 보고하고 같은 뉴스를 두 번 안 만들게 적는다\nimport os, json, glob, time, sqlite3\n\nBASE = os.path.join(os.environ.get(\"LOCALAPPDATA\", \".\"), \"mynerd\")\nFORM = os.path.join(BASE, \"storycard_form.json\")\nJOB = os.path.join(BASE, \"storycard_job.json\")\nSEEN = os.path.join(BASE, \"newscard_seen.json\")\n\nraw = open(\"input.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\").read().strip()\n\n\ndef load(p):\n    try:\n        return json.load(open(p, encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n    except Exception:\n        return {}\n\n\ndef unq(v):\n    v = (\"\" if v is None else str(v)).strip()\n    if len(v) >= 2 and v[0] == v[-1] and v[0] in ('\"', \"'\"):\n        v = v[1:-1]\n    return v.replace(\"\\\\\\\\\", \"\\\\\").strip()\n\n\ndef out_root():\n    try:\n        con = sqlite3.connect(\"C:\\\\Mynerd\\\\config.db\")\n        r = con.execute(\"SELECT value FROM config WHERE key=?\", (\"SYSTEM.out_root\",)).fetchone()\n        con.close()\n        if r and str(r[0]).strip():\n            return unq(r[0])\n    except Exception:\n        pass\n    return os.path.join(os.path.expanduser(\"~\"), \"Documents\", \"MYNERD\")\n\n\nSTORY = os.path.join(out_root(), \"images\", \"cardnews\", \"story\")\nform = load(FORM)\njob = load(JOB)\n\nL = []\nmade = \".mp4\" in raw\nif made:\n    L.append(\"영상이 만들어졌습니다.\")\nelse:\n    L.append(\"이번에는 만들어진 영상이 없습니다.\")\nL.append(\"\")\nL.append(raw[:900] if raw else \"(기록 없음)\")\n\ntry:\n    target = float(form.get(\"target_seconds\") or 0)\nexcept Exception:\n    target = 0.0\ndirs = [d for d in glob.glob(os.path.join(STORY, \"narration_*\")) if os.path.isdir(d)]\nif target and dirs:\n    newest = max(dirs, key=os.path.getmtime)\n    if time.time() - os.path.getmtime(newest) < 3 * 3600:\n        meta = load(os.path.join(newest, \"_narration.json\"))\n        total = 0.0\n        try:\n            total = float(meta.get(\"total_sec\") or 0)\n        except Exception:\n            total = 0.0\n        if total:\n            L.append(\"\")\n            L.append(\"목표 %.0f초 / 실제 %.1f초 (차이 %+.1f초)\" % (target, total, total - target))\n\nif job:\n    L.append(\"\")\n    L.append(\"원 기사: \" + str(job.get(\"title\") or \"\"))\n    if job.get(\"url\"):\n        L.append(\"주소: \" + str(job.get(\"url\") or \"\"))\n\nkey = str(job.get(\"key\") or \"\")\nif made and (key.startswith(\"hn:\") or key.startswith(\"hf:\")):\n    try:\n        seen = load(SEEN)\n        if not isinstance(seen, dict):\n            seen = {}\n        seen[key] = time.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M\")\n        with open(SEEN, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            json.dump(seen, f, ensure_ascii=False)\n        L.append(\"같은 뉴스로 다시 만들지 않도록 적어두었습니다.\")\n    except Exception:\n        pass\n\nprint(\"\\n\".join(L))\n", "id": "report", "label": "결과 정리", "timeout": 60, "type": "code"}, {"id": "out1", "label": "결과", "type": "output"}]}, "embedded_agents": {"287": {"name": "니나", "role": "이야기 문구 쓰기 담당 — You write a short news story video script as ONE JSON object. Output ONLY the JSON. No markdown fences, no comments, no text before or after the JSON.\n\nThe input gives you: SCENES (how many scenes), LANG (en or ko), BUDGET (narration length limit per scene), and ARTICLE (the news to tell).\n\nJSON shape:\n{\"title\": \"topic in 2 to 4 words\", \"scenes\": [ exactly SCENES items ]}\n\nScene items, in order:\n- First scene must be: {\"type\":\"cover\",\"kicker\":\"WORD\",\"kicker2\":\"WORD\",\"headline1\":\".", "engine": "gemma4:26b"}}, "skills": {"뉴스 카드 만들기": {"SKILL.md": "---\nname: 뉴스 카드 만들기\ndescription: AI·온디바이스·로컬 LLM 뉴스 한 건을 MYNERD 톤의 카드뉴스 이미지로 만든다. 내용을 JSON 으로 주면 SVG 를 그려 PNG 로 굽는다. 스레드용 세로형과 인스타용 정사각형 두 벌이 나온다. 강조색 다섯 벌 중 뉴스 성격에 맞는 것을 고른다.\nrun: scripts/run.py\n---\n\n# 뉴스 카드 만들기\n\nAI 뉴스 한 건을 카드 이미지로 만든다. 웹사이트(mynerd.io)와 같은 톤을 쓴다.\n\n## 어떻게 부르나\n\n입력은 JSON 한 덩이다. `input.txt` 로 받는다.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"kicker\": \"ON-DEVICE\",\n  \"kicker2\": \"AGENTS\",\n  \"headline1\": \"A real agent,\",\n  \"headline2\": \"not a demo\",\n  \"standfirst\": \"Liquid AI shipped an agent that runs 75 tools locally\",\n  \"screen_label\": \"LOCAL RUNTIME\",\n  \"big\": \"75\",\n  \"big_line1\": \"tools - security scans, file\",\n  \"big_line2\": \"operations, audit logs\",\n  \"stamp\": \"NOTHING LEAVES\",\n  \"kicker_note1\": \"Local stops being the\",\n  \"kicker_note2\": \"compromise option.\",\n  \"source\": \"VIA THURSDAI\",\n  \"issue\": \"NO. 001 - AUG 2026\",\n  \"palette\": \"lime\",\n  \"shape\": \"square\",\n  \"lang\": \"en\",\n  \"seed\": 7,\n  \"out\": \"C:/Users/.../Documents/MYNERD/images\"\n}\n```\n\n빠진 칸은 알아서 채우거나 비운다. 오류로 멈추지 않는다.\n\n## 강조색 고르는 법\n\n색이 뜻을 갖는다. 뉴스 성격에 맞춰 고른다.\n\n| 값 | 색 | 언제 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `lime` | 라임 | 로컬·온디바이스·출시 |\n| `orange` | 주황 | 하드웨어·속도·성능 비교 |\n| `violet` | 보라 | 모델 공개·연구 |\n| `teal` | 청록 | 프라이버시·보안·규제 |\n| `coral` | 산호 | 위험·실패·서비스 중단 |\n\n크림(#EAE7DF)과 먹색(#0D0D0D)은 어느 색을 골라도 고정이다. 그래야 한 계정 것으로 보인다.\n비우면 `lime`.\n\n## 글자 길이 지킬 것\n\n칸을 넘치면 그림이 깨진다. 넘치면 스크립트가 잘라내지만, 처음부터 맞춰 쓰는 게 낫다.\n\n- `headline1` / `headline2` : 각 14자 이내. 두 줄로 나눠 쓴다\n- `standfirst` : 58자 이내 한 줄\n- `big` : 4자 이내 (숫자가 없으면 `LOCAL` 같은 짧은 단어)\n- `big_line1` / `big_line2` : 각 32자 이내\n- `stamp` : 18자 이내 대문자\n- `kicker_note1` / `kicker_note2` : 각 26자 이내\n- `kicker` / `kicker2` : 각 12자 이내 대문자\n\n한국어는 글자 폭이 넓다. 위 숫자의 60% 정도로 잡는다.\n\n## 모양\n\n- `shape: \"tall\"` — 680x860. 스레드용\n- `shape: \"square\"` — 800x800. 인스타용\n- 둘 다 필요하면 두 번 부른다\n\n## 콜라주가 매번 달라지게\n\n`seed` 숫자를 바꾸면 조각 각도와 위치가 조금씩 달라진다. 같은 내용이라도 다른 그림이 나온다.\n뉴스마다 다른 값을 준다. 날짜에서 뽑아 써도 된다.\n\n## 지킬 것\n\n- 제목은 사실만. 과장하지 않는다. \"혁명적\", \"게임체인저\" 같은 말을 쓰지 않는다\n- 출처를 반드시 넣는다\n- 확인 안 된 숫자를 크게 넣지 않는다\n- 영문판과 한글판은 따로 부른다. 한 카드에 두 언어를 섞지 않는다\n\n## 나오는 것\n\n`out` 폴더에 PNG 두 개가 생긴다. 파일 이름은 `card_<날짜시각>_<모양>.png`.\n표준출력으로 만들어진 파일 경로를 알려준다.\n\n## 필요한 것\n\n`cairosvg` 또는 `Pillow`. 없으면 SVG 파일만 남기고 그 경로를 알려준다.\n\n<!-- MN_NEWSCARD_SKILL_MOTION_DOC_V1 -->\n\n## 움직이는 카드 (SNS 올림용)\n\n멈춰 있는 그림 대신 짧은 영상을 만들려면 `scripts/motion.py` 를 부른다.\n같은 JSON 을 그대로 쓰고 칸 몇 개만 더한다.\n\n```\npython \"scripts/motion.py\" 내용.json\n```\n\n더 쓰는 칸\n\n| 칸 | 뜻 | 비우면 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `photo_query` | 배경으로 쓸 사진 검색어. 영어로 쓴다 | 코드로 그린 배경 |\n| `seconds` | 길이(초). 3~15 | 6 |\n| `fps` | 1초에 몇 장. 12~30 | 24 |\n| `shape` | `tall` 1080x1350 / `square` 1080x1080 / `story` 1080x1920 | tall |\n\n나오는 것은 MP4 하나와 커버 그림(PNG) 하나다. 커버는 마지막 장면이라\n글만 올릴 때 대표 그림으로 쓸 수 있다.\n\n### 움직임 순서\n\n왼쪽 강조 띠가 자란다 -> 머리말이 밀려 들어온다 -> 제목 두 줄이 차례로 올라온다\n-> 밑줄이 그어진다 -> 부제가 뜬다 -> 큰 숫자가 0부터 세어 올라간다 -> 도장이 찍힌다.\n마지막 15% 는 멈춰 있다. 읽을 시간을 준다.\n\n### 사진\n\n펙셀을 먼저 보고, 없으면 언스플래시를 본다. 열쇠는 설정에 넣는다.\n\n- `SYSTEM.byok_pexels_key`\n- `SYSTEM.byok_unsplash_key`\n\n둘 다 없으면 사진 없이 코드로 그린 배경으로 돈다. 오류로 멈추지 않는다.\n받은 사진은 먹색과 강조색 두 색조로 바꿔 우리 톤에 맞춘다.\n사진을 쓰면 카드 아래에 작가 이름과 출처가 들어가고, 같은 폴더의\n`사진 출처.txt` 에도 한 줄 남는다.\n\n### 지킬 것\n\n- 다 구운 뒤 스스로 검사한다. 길이와 화면 크기를 읽어 확인하고,\n  통과하지 못하면 만들었다고 말하지 않는다\n- 글꼴은 설치하지 않는다. `C:\\Mynerd_tools\\fonts` 의 파일을 경로로 직접 쓴다\n  (Archivo Black / Space Mono / Archivo / Pretendard)\n- 한글이 든 글은 자동으로 Pretendard 로 갈린다\n", "scripts/characters.py": "# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n# MN_NEWSCARD_CHARS_V1\n# 로고 도형 캐릭터 넷: 노디(Nodi/N) 루피(Loopi/L) 트리기(Trigi/T) 넥시(Nexi/X)\n# 얼굴은 눈만 있다. 구멍과 홈을 섞어 상태를 나타낸다.\nimport math\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw\n\nINK = (13, 13, 13)\nCREAM = (234, 231, 223)\n\nCHARS = {\n    \"nodi\":  {\"color\": (185, 227, 75),  \"deep\": (76, 107, 27),  \"initial\": \"N\"},\n    \"loopi\": {\"color\": (31, 181, 140),  \"deep\": (12, 84, 67),   \"initial\": \"L\"},\n    \"trigi\": {\"color\": (240, 122, 33),  \"deep\": (138, 58, 12),  \"initial\": \"T\"},\n    \"nexi\":  {\"color\": (124, 92, 224),  \"deep\": (59, 42, 120),  \"initial\": \"X\"},\n}\n\n# MN_NEWSCARD_CHARS_V2 - 눈은 도형 경계 안쪽에 여유를 두고 앉는다\nEYES = {\n    \"nodi\":  [(0.35, 0.47), (0.65, 0.47)],\n    \"loopi\": [(0.36, 0.44), (0.64, 0.44)],\n    \"trigi\": [(0.20, 0.76), (0.44, 0.85)],\n    \"nexi\":  [(0.19, 0.38), (0.41, 0.38)],  # MN_NEWSCARD_CHARS_V4\n}\n\nEYE_R = {\"nodi\": 0.092, \"loopi\": 0.084, \"trigi\": 0.072, \"nexi\": 0.082}\n\n\ndef body_points(kind, s):\n    if kind == \"trigi\":\n        return [(0, s), (s, s), (0, s * 0.22)]\n    if kind == \"nexi\":\n        return [(0, 0), (s, 0), (s * 0.5, s * 0.5), (s, s), (0, s)]\n    return None\n\n\ndef _shape(d, kind, s, off, fill):\n    pts = body_points(kind, s)\n    if pts:\n        d.polygon([(x + off, y + off) for x, y in pts], fill=fill)\n    elif kind == \"loopi\":\n        d.ellipse([off, off, s + off, s + off], fill=fill)\n    else:\n        d.rounded_rectangle([off, off, s + off, s + off], radius=int(s * 0.07), fill=fill)\n\n\ndef _eye(d, cx, cy, r, state, open_k=1.0):\n    \"\"\"state: normal work surprise happy alert sleep\"\"\"\n    if state == \"surprise\":\n        r = r * 1.32\n    hh = max(1, int(r * 2 * open_k))\n    if state in (\"work\", \"sleep\") or open_k < 0.42:\n        h = max(2, int(r * (0.62 if state == \"work\" else 0.34) * 2 * max(open_k, 0.25)))\n        w = int(r * 2.05)\n        d.rounded_rectangle([cx - w // 2, cy - h // 2, cx + w // 2, cy + h // 2],\n                            radius=h // 2, fill=INK)\n        return\n    if state == \"happy\":\n        w = int(r * 2.1)\n        th = max(3, int(r * 0.55))\n        d.arc([cx - w // 2, cy - int(r * 0.5), cx + w // 2, cy + int(r * 1.5)],\n              start=180, end=360, fill=INK, width=th)\n        return\n    if state == \"alert\":\n        w = int(r * 2.05)\n        h = max(3, int(r * 0.72))\n        lay = Image.new(\"RGBA\", (w + 8, h + 8), (0, 0, 0, 0))\n        ld = ImageDraw.Draw(lay)\n        ld.rounded_rectangle([4, 4, w, h], radius=h // 2, fill=INK)\n        ang = 15 if cx % 2 == 0 else -15\n        lay = lay.rotate(ang, expand=True, resample=Image.BICUBIC)\n        return lay, (cx - lay.width // 2, cy - lay.height // 2)\n    d.ellipse([cx - r, cy - hh // 2, cx + r, cy + hh // 2], fill=INK)\n    return\n\n\n# MN_NEWSCARD_CHARS_V3\ndef render(kind, size, state=\"normal\", open_k=1.0, tint=None, eye_alpha=1.0,\n           shadow_k=1.0, look=(0.0, 0.0)):\n    \"\"\"캐릭터 한 마리를 그려 RGBA 이미지로 돌려준다. tint 를 주면 그 색으로 물든다.\"\"\"\n    kind = kind if kind in CHARS else \"nodi\"\n    s = int(size)\n    off = max(0, int(s * 0.075 * max(0.0, min(1.0, shadow_k))))\n    im = Image.new(\"RGBA\", (s + off + 2, s + off + 2), (0, 0, 0, 0))\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(im)\n\n    col = tint or CHARS[kind][\"color\"]\n    deep = CHARS[kind][\"deep\"] if tint is None else tuple(\n        max(0, int(c * 0.55)) for c in tint)\n\n    if off > 0:\n        _shape(d, kind, s, off, deep + (255,))\n    _shape(d, kind, s, 0, col + (255,))\n\n    if eye_alpha > 0.02 and open_k > 0.04:\n        r = int(s * EYE_R[kind])\n        pend = []\n        for ex, ey in EYES[kind]:\n            cx = int(s * (ex + look[0]))\n            cy = int(s * (ey + look[1]))\n            got = _eye(d, cx, cy, r, state, open_k)\n            if got:\n                pend.append(got)\n        for lay, pos in pend:\n            im.alpha_composite(lay, pos)\n        if eye_alpha < 0.99:\n            a = im.split()[3]\n            im.putalpha(a)\n\n    return im\n\n\ndef paste(canvas, kind, size, xy, state=\"normal\", open_k=1.0, angle=0.0,\n          squash=1.0, tint=None, look=(0.0, 0.0)):\n    im = render(kind, size, state, open_k, tint, look=look)\n    if squash != 1.0:\n        w = max(1, int(im.width * (2.0 - squash)))\n        h = max(1, int(im.height * squash))\n        im = im.resize((w, h), Image.BICUBIC)\n    if angle:\n        im = im.rotate(angle, expand=True, resample=Image.BICUBIC)\n    canvas.alpha_composite(im, (int(xy[0]), int(xy[1])))\n    return im\n\n\ndef state_for(palette):\n    return {\"lime\": \"happy\", \"violet\": \"normal\", \"orange\": \"normal\",\n            \"teal\": \"alert\", \"coral\": \"surprise\"}.get(palette, \"normal\")\n\n\ndef lead_for(palette):\n    return {\"lime\": \"trigi\", \"violet\": \"nodi\", \"orange\": \"trigi\",\n            \"teal\": \"nexi\", \"coral\": \"loopi\"}.get(palette, \"nodi\")\n\n\n# ---------- 엔딩: 넷이 모여 로고가 된다 ----------\n\nLOGO = 210.0\nSLOTS = {\n    \"nodi\":  (23.81, 23.81, 75.52),\n    \"loopi\": (110.67, 23.81, 75.52),\n    \"trigi\": (23.81, 110.82, 75.52),\n    \"nexi\":  (110.67, 110.82, 75.52),\n}\nFLY = {\"nodi\": (-1.1, -0.8), \"loopi\": (1.2, -0.7),\n       \"trigi\": (-1.0, 1.1), \"nexi\": (1.15, 1.0)}\nORDER = [\"nodi\", \"loopi\", \"trigi\", \"nexi\"]\n\n\ndef _mix(c1, c2, k):\n    k = max(0.0, min(1.0, k))\n    return tuple(int(c1[i] + (c2[i] - c1[i]) * k) for i in range(3))\n\n\ndef build_logo(canvas, p, box, accent):\n    \"\"\"p 0~1 동안 넷이 날아와 로고가 완성된다. box=(x,y,size)\"\"\"\n    bx, by, bs = box\n    k = bs / LOGO\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(canvas, \"RGBA\")\n\n    gp = M_ease(seg(p, 0.34, 0.52))\n    if gp > 0:\n        pad = bs * 0.5 * (1 - gp)\n        d.rounded_rectangle([bx + pad, by + pad, bx + bs - pad, by + bs - pad],\n                            radius=int(bs * 0.055 * gp), fill=accent + (255,))\n\n    for i, kind in enumerate(ORDER):\n        a0 = 0.02 + i * 0.07\n        g = M_ease(seg(p, a0, a0 + 0.26))\n        if g <= 0:\n            continue\n        sx, sy, ss = SLOTS[kind]\n        tx = bx + sx * k\n        ty = by + sy * k\n        size = ss * k\n        fx, fy = FLY[kind]\n        cx = tx + fx * bs * 0.75 * (1 - g)\n        cy = ty + fy * bs * 0.75 * (1 - g)\n\n        m = seg(p, 0.44, 0.60)\n        tint = _mix(CHARS[kind][\"color\"], (35, 24, 21), m) if m > 0 else None\n        ok = 1.0 - seg(p, 0.46, 0.60)\n        sh = 1.0 - seg(p, 0.44, 0.58)\n        im = render(kind, size, \"normal\", ok, tint, shadow_k=sh)\n        canvas.alpha_composite(im, (int(cx), int(cy)))\n\n\ndef seg(p, a, b):\n    if b <= a:\n        return 1.0 if p >= b else 0.0\n    return max(0.0, min(1.0, (p - a) / (b - a)))\n\n\ndef M_ease(t):\n    t = max(0.0, min(1.0, t))\n    return 1 - pow(1 - t, 3)\n", "scripts/cleanup.py": "# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"MN_NEWSCARD_CLEANUP_V2 - 완성본에 이름을 붙여 따로 담고, 과정본은 치운다.\n\n쓰는 법:\n    python cleanup.py --title 리퀴드AI\n        무엇을 할지 보여주기만 한다(건드리지 않음)\n\n    python cleanup.py --title 리퀴드AI --do\n        실제로 정리한다\n\n    python cleanup.py --title 리퀴드AI --do --sound 소리있는영상.mp4 --lang 영어\n        영상 하나만 지정해 담을 때\n\n무엇을 하나:\n    소리가 얹힌 영상을 찾아 '완성본' 폴더로 옮기고 이름을 바꾼다.\n        카드뉴스_<주제>_<언어>_<날짜>.mp4\n    짝이 되는 표지 그림도 함께 옮긴다.\n    나머지(소리 없는 원본, 옛 판, 나레이션 소리, 기록)는 '과정(치운것)' 으로 옮긴다.\n\n언어는 나레이션 기록을 보고 스스로 가린다. 못 가리면 파일 이름에 넣지 않는다.\n치운 것은 지우지 않는다. 필요하면 도로 꺼낼 수 있다.\n\"\"\"\nimport os\nimport re\nimport sys\nimport glob\nimport json\nimport shutil\nimport datetime\n\nBASE = r\"C:\\Users\\fugus\\Documents\\MYNERD\\images\\cardnews\\story\"\nDONE_NAME = \"완성본\"\nTRASH_NAME = \"과정(치운것)\"\n\n\ndef _arg(name, default=\"\"):\n    if name in sys.argv:\n        try:\n            return sys.argv[sys.argv.index(name) + 1]\n        except Exception:\n            return default\n    return default\n\n\ndef _stamp_of(name):\n    m = re.search(r\"(\\d{8})_(\\d{6})\", name)\n    return (m.group(1), m.group(2)) if m else (\"\", \"\")\n\n\ndef _lang_of(stamp_pair):\n    \"\"\"그 영상을 만든 나레이션 기록을 찾아 언어를 가린다.\"\"\"\n    day, hms = stamp_pair\n    best = \"\"\n    for meta in sorted(glob.glob(os.path.join(BASE, \"narration_*\", \"_narration.json\"))):\n        try:\n            f = open(meta, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n            try:\n                d = json.loads(f.read())\n            finally:\n                f.close()\n        except Exception:\n            continue\n        lang = str(d.get(\"lang\") or \"\")\n        # 나레이션 폴더 시각이 영상 시각보다 앞이면서 가장 가까운 것\n        md, mh = _stamp_of(os.path.basename(os.path.dirname(meta)))\n        if md == day and mh <= hms:\n            best = lang\n    if best == \"ko\":\n        return \"한국어\"\n    if best:\n        return \"영어\"\n    return \"\"\n\n\n# MN_NEWSCARD_AUTOCHAIN_V1 - 인자 없이도 앞 걸음의 산출물을 스스로 찾는다\n_MN_BASE = r\"C:\\Users\\fugus\\Documents\\MYNERD\\images\\cardnews\\story\"\n\n\ndef _mn_read_input_txt():\n    try:\n        if os.path.isfile(\"input.txt\"):\n            return open(\"input.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\").read().strip()\n    except Exception:\n        pass\n    return \"\"\n\n\ndef _mn_paths_in_text(text):\n    import re as _re\n    found = []\n    for ln in text.splitlines():\n        cands = [ln.strip()]\n        if \": \" in ln:\n            cands.append(ln.split(\": \", 1)[1].strip())\n        cands.extend(_re.split(r\"[\\s\\\"\\']+\", ln))\n        for c in cands:\n            c = c.strip().rstrip(\",\")\n            if len(c) > 3 and os.path.isfile(c) and c not in found:\n                found.append(c)\n    return found\n\n\ndef _mn_newest(patterns, skip_suffix=\"\"):\n    import glob as _glob\n    cands = []\n    for pat in patterns:\n        cands.extend(_glob.glob(pat))\n    cands = [p for p in cands if os.path.isfile(p)]\n    if skip_suffix:\n        cands = [p for p in cands if not p.lower().endswith(skip_suffix)]\n    if not cands:\n        return \"\"\n    return max(cands, key=os.path.getmtime)\n\n\ndef _mn_guess_title(raw):\n    for ln in (raw or \"\").splitlines():\n        s = ln.strip()\n        for key in (\"제목:\", \"title:\", \"Title:\"):\n            if s.startswith(key):\n                t = s[len(key):].strip()\n                if t:\n                    return t\n    p = _mn_newest([os.path.join(BASE, \"_job*.json\"), os.path.join(BASE, \"*\", \"_job*.json\")])\n    if p:\n        try:\n            d = json.loads(open(p, encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\").read())\n            t = str(d.get(\"title\") or \"\").strip()\n            if t:\n                return t\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n    return \"\"\n\n\ndef main():\n    do = \"--do\" in sys.argv\n    title = _arg(\"--title\", \"\").strip()\n    one = _arg(\"--sound\", \"\").strip()\n    lang_fix = _arg(\"--lang\", \"\").strip()\n\n    raw = _mn_read_input_txt()\n    if raw and \"--do\" not in sys.argv and \"--title\" not in sys.argv and \"--sound\" not in sys.argv:\n        do = True\n        for p in _mn_paths_in_text(raw):\n            if p.lower().endswith(\"_sound.mp4\"):\n                one = p\n                break\n        if not one:\n            # MN_NEWSCARD_AUTOCHAIN_V2 - 나레이션 없는 회차는 소리 없는 영상을 완성본으로 담는다\n            for p in _mn_paths_in_text(raw):\n                if p.lower().endswith(\".mp4\"):\n                    one = p\n                    break\n    if not title:\n        title = _mn_guess_title(raw) or \"카드뉴스\"\n\n    if not os.path.isdir(BASE):\n        print(\"[오류] 산출물 폴더가 없습니다: \" + BASE)\n        return 1\n\n    done_dir = os.path.join(BASE, DONE_NAME)\n    trash_dir = os.path.join(BASE, TRASH_NAME)\n\n    if one:\n        finals = [os.path.join(BASE, one)] if not os.path.isabs(one) else [one]\n    else:\n        finals = sorted(glob.glob(os.path.join(BASE, \"story_*_sound.mp4\")))\n\n    finals = [p for p in finals if os.path.isfile(p)]\n    if not finals:\n        print(\"[멈춤] 소리가 얹힌 완성본이 없습니다. 아무것도 하지 않습니다.\")\n        return 1\n\n    plan = []\n    for p in finals:\n        base = os.path.basename(p)\n        day, hms = _stamp_of(base)\n        lang = lang_fix or _lang_of((day, hms))\n        parts = [\"카드뉴스\", title]\n        if lang:\n            parts.append(lang)\n        if day:\n            parts.append(day)\n        newname = \"_\".join(parts) + \".mp4\"\n        cover = p.replace(\"_sound.mp4\", \"_cover.png\")\n        newcover = \"_\".join([\"카드뉴스\", title] + ([lang] if lang else []) + [\"표지\"]) + \".png\"\n        plan.append((p, newname, cover if os.path.isfile(cover) else \"\", newcover))\n\n    print(\"완성본으로 담을 것 %d 개\" % len(plan))\n    for src, newname, cover, newcover in plan:\n        mb = os.path.getsize(src) / 1048576.0\n        print(\"  %s\" % os.path.basename(src))\n        print(\"    -> %-46s %.1f MB\" % (newname, mb))\n        if cover:\n            print(\"    -> %s\" % newcover)\n    print(\"\")\n\n    keep_set = set()\n    for src, _, cover, _ in plan:\n        keep_set.add(src)\n        if cover:\n            keep_set.add(cover)\n\n    move = []\n    for pat in (\"story_*.mp4\", \"story_*_cover.png\", \"narration_*\", \"_frames_*\", \"*.log\"):\n        for p in sorted(glob.glob(os.path.join(BASE, pat))):\n            if p in keep_set:\n                continue\n            if os.path.basename(p) in (DONE_NAME, TRASH_NAME):\n                continue\n            move.append(p)\n\n    total = 0.0\n    print(\"치울 것 %d 개\" % len(move))\n    for p in move:\n        if os.path.isdir(p):\n            sz = 0\n            for dp, dn, fn in os.walk(p):\n                for f2 in fn:\n                    try:\n                        sz += os.path.getsize(os.path.join(dp, f2))\n                    except Exception:\n                        pass\n        else:\n            try:\n                sz = os.path.getsize(p)\n            except Exception:\n                sz = 0\n        total += sz\n    print(\"  합계 %.1f MB\" % (total / 1048576.0))\n    print(\"\")\n\n    if not do:\n        print(\"[미리보기] 실제로 정리하려면 --do 를 붙여 다시 부르세요.\")\n        return 0\n\n    for d in (done_dir, trash_dir):\n        if not os.path.isdir(d):\n            os.makedirs(d)\n\n    kept = []\n    for src, newname, cover, newcover in plan:\n        try:\n            t = os.path.join(done_dir, newname)\n            shutil.move(src, t)\n            kept.append(t)\n            if cover:\n                shutil.move(cover, os.path.join(done_dir, newcover))\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(\"  담지 못함: %s (%s)\" % (os.path.basename(src), str(e)[:60]))\n\n    stamp = datetime.datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y%m%d_%H%M%S\")\n    sub = os.path.join(trash_dir, stamp)\n    os.makedirs(sub)\n    moved = 0\n    for p in move:\n        if not os.path.exists(p):\n            continue\n        try:\n            shutil.move(p, os.path.join(sub, os.path.basename(p)))\n            moved += 1\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(\"  치우지 못함: %s (%s)\" % (os.path.basename(p), str(e)[:60]))\n\n    # 스스로 검사 - 담은 것이 제자리에 있고 열 만한 크기인지\n    bad = []\n    for t in kept:\n        if not os.path.isfile(t):\n            bad.append(os.path.basename(t) + \" 가 사라졌습니다\")\n        elif os.path.getsize(t) < 500000:\n            bad.append(os.path.basename(t) + \" 가 너무 작습니다\")\n    if not kept:\n        bad.append(\"완성본을 하나도 담지 못했습니다\")\n\n    print(\"\")\n    if bad:\n        print(\"[검사 미통과]\")\n        for b in bad:\n            print(\"  - \" + b)\n        print(\"치운 것은 여기 있습니다: \" + sub)\n        return 1\n\n    print(\"[DONE] 완성본 %d 개를 담고 %d 개를 치웠습니다.\" % (len(kept), moved))\n    print(\"완성본: \" + done_dir)\n    print(\"치운 것: \" + sub)\n    return 0\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    sys.exit(main())\n", "scripts/mix.py": "# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"MN_NEWSCARD_MIX_V1 - 영상에 나레이션과 배경음을 얹는다.\n\n쓰는 법:\n    python mix.py <_narration.json> <영상.mp4> [내보낼 파일.mp4]\n\n배경음:\n    C:\\Mynerd_tools\\bgm 에 wav/mp3 가 있으면 그중 하나를 쓴다(이름순 첫 번째,\n    또는 서식의 bgm 칸에 적힌 파일). 없으면 코드로 조용한 배경음을 만든다.\n    코드로 만든 소리는 저작권이 없어 공식 계정에 반복해 써도 문제가 없다.\n\"\"\"\nimport os\nimport sys\nimport json\nimport wave\nimport math\nimport struct\nimport shutil\nimport subprocess\n\nFFMPEG = r\"C:\\Mynerd_tools\\bin\\ffmpeg.exe\"\nBGM_DIR = r\"C:\\Mynerd_tools\\bgm\"\nRATE = 44100\n\n# MN_NEWSCARD_BGM_TUNE_V1 : 진짜 음원 기준으로 다시 잡은 크기\nBGM_GAIN = 0.20        # 말이 없을 때 배경음 크기\nDUCK_GAIN = 0.055      # 말이 나오는 동안 이만큼까지 낮춘다 (약 4분의 1)\nDUCK_FADE = 0.45       # 낮추고 올리는 데 걸리는 시간 - 길수록 자연스럽다\nVOICE_GAIN = 0.95\nBGM_NORM = 0.70        # 곡마다 녹음 크기가 달라 먼저 이 수준으로 고르게 맞춘다\n\n\ndef _ffmpeg():\n    if os.path.isfile(FFMPEG):\n        return FFMPEG\n    p = shutil.which(\"ffmpeg\")\n    return p or FFMPEG\n\n\ndef _read_wav(path):\n    f = wave.open(path, \"rb\")\n    try:\n        ch = f.getnchannels()\n        sw = f.getsampwidth()\n        sr = f.getframerate()\n        n = f.getnframes()\n        raw = f.readframes(n)\n    finally:\n        f.close()\n    if sw != 2:\n        raise Exception(\"2바이트 소리만 다룹니다: \" + path)\n    data = struct.unpack(\"<%dh\" % (len(raw) // 2), raw)\n    if ch == 2:\n        data = [(data[i] + data[i + 1]) // 2 for i in range(0, len(data) - 1, 2)]\n    return list(data), sr\n\n\ndef _resample(x, src, dst):\n    if src == dst or not x:\n        return x\n    ratio = float(dst) / float(src)\n    out_n = int(len(x) * ratio)\n    out = [0] * out_n\n    for i in range(out_n):\n        pos = i / ratio\n        j = int(pos)\n        if j + 1 < len(x):\n            f = pos - j\n            out[i] = int(x[j] * (1.0 - f) + x[j + 1] * f)\n        elif j < len(x):\n            out[i] = x[j]\n    return out\n\n\ndef _midi_hz(m):\n    return 440.0 * (2.0 ** ((m - 69) / 12.0))\n\n\ndef _make_bgm(total_sec):\n    \"\"\"MN_NEWSCARD_BGM_MUSIC_V1 - 멜로디와 리듬이 있는 곡을 짓는다.\n\n    네 마디 단조 진행을 반복하고 그 위에 베이스, 짧게 튕기는 아르페지오,\n    얇은 패드, 아주 약한 하이햇을 얹는다. 말을 가리지 않도록 중음역은 비워 둔다.\n    남의 곡을 따라 만들지 않으므로 저작권이 없다.\n    \"\"\"\n    import numpy as np\n\n    sr = RATE\n    n = int(total_sec * sr)\n    out = np.zeros(n, dtype=np.float64)\n\n    BPM = 82.0\n    beat = 60.0 / BPM\n    bar = beat * 4.0\n\n    # Am - F - C - G : 어디에나 쓰이는 진행이라 특정 곡의 것이 아니다\n    prog = [\n        (45, [57, 60, 64]),\n        (41, [53, 57, 60]),\n        (48, [55, 60, 64]),\n        (43, [55, 59, 62]),\n    ]\n\n    def add(start, dur, freq, amp, harm, decay=None, attack=0.008):\n        i0 = int(start * sr)\n        if i0 >= n:\n            return\n        i1 = min(n, i0 + int(dur * sr))\n        L = i1 - i0\n        if L <= 8:\n            return\n        tt = np.arange(L) / float(sr)\n        w = np.zeros(L)\n        for k, a in enumerate(harm, 1):\n            w += a * np.sin(2.0 * np.pi * freq * k * tt)\n        env = np.ones(L)\n        at = max(1, int(attack * sr))\n        if at < L:\n            env[:at] = np.linspace(0.0, 1.0, at)\n        if decay:\n            env *= np.exp(-tt / decay)\n        rel = max(1, int(min(0.18, dur * 0.25) * sr))\n        if rel < L:\n            env[-rel:] *= np.linspace(1.0, 0.0, rel)\n        out[i0:i1] += w * env * amp\n\n    def hat(start, amp):\n        i0 = int(start * sr)\n        L = int(0.045 * sr)\n        if i0 >= n or i0 + L > n:\n            return\n        rng = np.random.RandomState(int(start * 1000) % 65536)\n        z = rng.randn(L)\n        # 낮은 쪽을 걷어내 '치' 소리만 남긴다\n        z = np.diff(np.concatenate([[0.0], z]))\n        env = np.exp(-np.arange(L) / (0.012 * sr))\n        out[i0:i0 + L] += z * env * amp\n\n    bars = int(math.ceil(total_sec / bar)) + 1\n    for b in range(bars):\n        t0 = b * bar\n        if t0 >= total_sec:\n            break\n        root, chord = prog[b % 4]\n\n        # 베이스 - 마디 머리에 길게\n        add(t0, bar * 0.92, _midi_hz(root - 12), 0.50,\n            (1.0, 0.30, 0.08), decay=1.9, attack=0.012)\n\n        # 패드 - 화음을 얇게 깔아 사이를 메운다\n        for m in chord:\n            add(t0, bar * 0.96, _midi_hz(m - 12), 0.085,\n                (1.0, 0.18), decay=None, attack=0.35)\n\n        # 아르페지오 - 여덟 번 짧게 튕긴다. 마디마다 순서를 바꿔 단조로움을 던다\n        order = [0, 1, 2, 1, 2, 0, 1, 2] if (b % 2 == 0) else [2, 1, 0, 1, 0, 2, 1, 0]\n        for i, oi in enumerate(order):\n            m = chord[oi]\n            if i in (3, 6):\n                m += 12          # 가끔 한 옥타브 올려 멜로디처럼 들리게\n            amp = 0.20 if i % 2 == 0 else 0.13\n            add(t0 + i * (beat / 2.0), beat * 0.62, _midi_hz(m), amp,\n                (1.0, 0.42, 0.16, 0.06), decay=0.30, attack=0.004)\n\n        # 하이햇 - 뒷박에만 아주 약하게\n        for i in range(4):\n            hat(t0 + i * beat + beat / 2.0, 0.055)\n\n    # 앞뒤를 부드럽게\n    fade = int(2.0 * sr)\n    if fade * 2 < n:\n        out[:fade] *= np.linspace(0.0, 1.0, fade)\n        out[-fade:] *= np.linspace(1.0, 0.0, fade)\n\n    peak = float(np.max(np.abs(out))) or 1.0\n    return (out / peak).tolist()\n\n\ndef _make_bgm_drone(total_sec):\n    \"\"\"예전 방식 - 화음만 웅웅거리는 소리. 지금은 쓰지 않는다.\"\"\"\n    n = int(total_sec * RATE)\n    out = [0.0] * n\n    # 낮은 음 세 개를 겹친다 (A2, E3, A3 근처)\n    tones = [(110.0, 0.55), (164.81, 0.32), (220.0, 0.18)]\n    for freq, amp in tones:\n        w = 2.0 * math.pi * freq / RATE\n        for i in range(n):\n            out[i] += amp * math.sin(w * i)\n    # 아주 느린 물결로 크기를 흔들어 기계음처럼 들리지 않게 한다\n    per = 7.5 * RATE\n    for i in range(n):\n        breath = 0.72 + 0.28 * math.sin(2.0 * math.pi * i / per)\n        out[i] *= breath\n    # 앞뒤를 부드럽게\n    fade = int(1.6 * RATE)\n    for i in range(min(fade, n)):\n        out[i] *= i / float(fade)\n        out[n - 1 - i] *= i / float(fade)\n    peak = max(1e-9, max(abs(v) for v in out))\n    return [v / peak for v in out]\n\n\ndef _load_bgm(total_sec, want=\"\"):\n    picked = \"\"\n    try:\n        if os.path.isdir(BGM_DIR):\n            names = [n for n in sorted(os.listdir(BGM_DIR))\n                     if n.lower().endswith((\".wav\", \".mp3\", \".m4a\", \".ogg\"))]\n            if want:\n                for n in names:\n                    if want.lower() in n.lower():\n                        picked = os.path.join(BGM_DIR, n)\n                        break\n            if not picked and names:\n                picked = os.path.join(BGM_DIR, names[0])\n    except Exception:\n        picked = \"\"\n\n    if not picked:\n        return _make_bgm(total_sec), \"코드로 만든 배경음\"\n\n    tmp = os.path.join(BGM_DIR, \"_bgm_tmp.wav\")\n    try:\n        subprocess.run([_ffmpeg(), \"-y\", \"-nostdin\", \"-i\", picked,\n                        \"-ac\", \"1\", \"-ar\", str(RATE), tmp],\n                       capture_output=True, timeout=300)\n        x, sr = _read_wav(tmp)\n        x = _resample(x, sr, RATE)\n        f = [v / 32768.0 for v in x]\n    except Exception:\n        return _make_bgm(total_sec), \"코드로 만든 배경음 (파일을 읽지 못했습니다)\"\n    finally:\n        try:\n            if os.path.isfile(tmp):\n                os.remove(tmp)\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n\n    need = int(total_sec * RATE)\n    if not f:\n        return _make_bgm(total_sec), \"코드로 만든 배경음 (파일이 비었습니다)\"\n\n    # MN_NEWSCARD_BGM_TUNE_V1 : 곡마다 녹음 크기가 다르므로 먼저 고르게 맞춘다.\n    # 이렇게 해야 곡을 바꿔도 배경음 크기가 들쭉날쭉하지 않다.\n    pk = max(abs(v) for v in f) or 1.0\n    f = [v * (BGM_NORM / pk) for v in f]\n\n    while len(f) < need:\n        f = f + f\n    f = f[:need]\n    fade = int(2.2 * RATE)\n    for i in range(min(fade, len(f))):\n        f[i] *= i / float(fade)\n        f[len(f) - 1 - i] *= i / float(fade)\n    return f, os.path.basename(picked)\n\n\n# MN_NEWSCARD_AUTOCHAIN_V1 - 인자 없이도 앞 걸음의 산출물을 스스로 찾는다\n_MN_BASE = r\"C:\\Users\\fugus\\Documents\\MYNERD\\images\\cardnews\\story\"\n\n\ndef _mn_read_input_txt():\n    try:\n        if os.path.isfile(\"input.txt\"):\n            return open(\"input.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\").read().strip()\n    except Exception:\n        pass\n    return \"\"\n\n\ndef _mn_paths_in_text(text):\n    import re as _re\n    found = []\n    for ln in text.splitlines():\n        cands = [ln.strip()]\n        if \": \" in ln:\n            cands.append(ln.split(\": \", 1)[1].strip())\n        cands.extend(_re.split(r\"[\\s\\\"\\']+\", ln))\n        for c in cands:\n            c = c.strip().rstrip(\",\")\n            if len(c) > 3 and os.path.isfile(c) and c not in found:\n                found.append(c)\n    return found\n\n\ndef _mn_newest(patterns, skip_suffix=\"\"):\n    import glob as _glob\n    cands = []\n    for pat in patterns:\n        cands.extend(_glob.glob(pat))\n    cands = [p for p in cands if os.path.isfile(p)]\n    if skip_suffix:\n        cands = [p for p in cands if not p.lower().endswith(skip_suffix)]\n    if not cands:\n        return \"\"\n    return max(cands, key=os.path.getmtime)\n\n\ndef _mn_find_mix_inputs():\n    raw = _mn_read_input_txt()\n    meta = \"\"\n    video = \"\"\n    if raw:\n        for p in _mn_paths_in_text(raw):\n            low = p.lower()\n            if low.endswith(\"_narration.json\") and not meta:\n                meta = p\n            elif low.endswith(\".mp4\") and not low.endswith(\"_sound.mp4\") and not video:\n                video = p\n    if not meta:\n        # MN_NEWSCARD_AUTOCHAIN_V2 - 이번 실행의 소리만 쓴다. 가장 최근 narration_ 폴더에\n        # 기록이 없으면 이번에는 나레이션을 끈 것이므로 옛 소리를 끌어다 붙이지 않는다.\n        import glob as _glob\n        dirs = [d for d in _glob.glob(os.path.join(_MN_BASE, \"narration_*\")) if os.path.isdir(d)]\n        if dirs:\n            newest = max(dirs, key=os.path.getmtime)\n            cand = os.path.join(newest, \"_narration.json\")\n            if os.path.isfile(cand):\n                meta = cand\n    if not video:\n        video = _mn_newest([os.path.join(_MN_BASE, \"story_*.mp4\")], skip_suffix=\"_sound.mp4\")\n    return meta, video\n\n\ndef main():\n    meta_path = \"\"\n    video = \"\"\n    if len(sys.argv) >= 3 and os.path.isfile(sys.argv[1]) and os.path.isfile(sys.argv[2]) and sys.argv[1].lower().endswith(\".json\"):\n        meta_path, video = sys.argv[1], sys.argv[2]\n    if not meta_path or not video:\n        meta_path, video = _mn_find_mix_inputs()\n    if video and os.path.isfile(video) and not meta_path:\n        print(\"[건너뜀] 이번 실행에는 나레이션이 없습니다. 소리 합치기를 건너뜁니다.\")\n        print(\"영상: \" + video)\n        return 0\n    if not (meta_path and video and os.path.isfile(meta_path) and os.path.isfile(video)):\n        print(\"[오류] 나레이션 기록(_narration.json)과 소리 없는 영상(.mp4)을 찾지 못했습니다.\")\n        print(\"쓰는 법: mix.py <_narration.json> <영상.mp4> [내보낼.mp4]  또는 input.txt 에 경로를 적어 주세요.\")\n        return 1\n    print(\"나레이션기록: \" + meta_path)\n    print(\"영상원본: \" + video)\n\n    f = open(meta_path, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    try:\n        meta = json.loads(f.read())\n    finally:\n        f.close()\n\n    items = meta.get(\"items\") or []\n    total = float(meta.get(\"total_sec\") or 0)\n    if total <= 0:\n        print(\"[오류] 전체 길이를 모르겠습니다.\")\n        return 1\n\n    n = int(total * RATE)\n    voice = [0.0] * n\n    speaking = [0.0] * n\n\n    placed = 0\n    for it in items:\n        wp = it.get(\"wav\") or \"\"\n        if not wp or not os.path.isfile(wp):\n            continue\n        x, sr = _read_wav(wp)\n        x = _resample(x, sr, RATE)\n        start = int((float(it.get(\"start\") or 0) + float(it.get(\"lead\") or 0)) * RATE)\n        for i, v in enumerate(x):\n            j = start + i\n            if 0 <= j < n:\n                voice[j] += (v / 32768.0) * VOICE_GAIN\n                speaking[j] = 1.0\n        placed += 1\n\n    # 말이 나오는 구간 앞뒤로 배경음을 부드럽게 낮춘다\n    fade = int(DUCK_FADE * RATE)\n    duck = [BGM_GAIN] * n\n    i = 0\n    while i < n:\n        if speaking[i] > 0:\n            j = i\n            while j < n and speaking[j] > 0:\n                j += 1\n            for k in range(max(0, i - fade), min(n, j + fade)):\n                if k < i:\n                    t = (i - k) / float(fade)\n                elif k >= j:\n                    t = (k - j + 1) / float(fade)\n                else:\n                    t = 0.0\n                t = max(0.0, min(1.0, t))\n                g = DUCK_GAIN + (BGM_GAIN - DUCK_GAIN) * t\n                if g < duck[k]:\n                    duck[k] = g\n            i = j\n        else:\n            i += 1\n\n    bgm, bgm_name = _load_bgm(total, str(meta.get(\"bgm\") or \"\"))\n\n    mixed = [0.0] * n\n    for i in range(n):\n        b = bgm[i] if i < len(bgm) else 0.0\n        mixed[i] = voice[i] + b * duck[i]\n\n    peak = max(1e-9, max(abs(v) for v in mixed))\n    if peak > 0.97:\n        scale = 0.97 / peak\n        mixed = [v * scale for v in mixed]\n\n    workdir = os.path.dirname(meta_path)\n    apath = os.path.join(workdir, \"_mixed.wav\")\n    g = wave.open(apath, \"wb\")\n    try:\n        g.setnchannels(1)\n        g.setsampwidth(2)\n        g.setframerate(RATE)\n        g.writeframes(struct.pack(\"<%dh\" % n,\n                                  *[max(-32768, min(32767, int(v * 32767))) for v in mixed]))\n    finally:\n        g.close()\n\n    out = sys.argv[3] if len(sys.argv) > 3 else os.path.splitext(video)[0] + \"_sound.mp4\"\n    # MN_NEWSCARD_MIX_MAP_V1 : 영상에 이미 무음 소리길이 있어, 어느 것을 쓸지 짚어준다.\n    r = subprocess.run([_ffmpeg(), \"-y\", \"-nostdin\", \"-i\", video, \"-i\", apath,\n                        \"-map\", \"0:v:0\", \"-map\", \"1:a:0\",\n                        \"-c:v\", \"copy\", \"-c:a\", \"aac\", \"-b:a\", \"192k\",\n                        \"-shortest\", out],\n                       capture_output=True, timeout=900)\n    if r.returncode != 0:\n        print(\"[오류] 합치지 못했습니다.\")\n        print(r.stderr.decode(\"utf-8\", \"ignore\")[-1200:])\n        return 1\n\n    print(\"소리합친영상: \" + out)\n\n    # 스스로 검사 - 결과가 실제로 열리고, 소리가 들어 있고, 길이가 맞는지\n    probe = shutil.which(\"ffprobe\") or os.path.join(os.path.dirname(_ffmpeg()), \"ffprobe.exe\")\n    dur = 0.0\n    has_audio = False\n    try:\n        rr = subprocess.run([probe, \"-v\", \"error\", \"-show_entries\",\n                             \"format=duration:stream=codec_type\",\n                             \"-of\", \"json\", out], capture_output=True, timeout=120)\n        d = json.loads(rr.stdout.decode(\"utf-8\", \"ignore\") or \"{}\")\n        dur = float((d.get(\"format\") or {}).get(\"duration\") or 0)\n        for s in (d.get(\"streams\") or []):\n            if s.get(\"codec_type\") == \"audio\":\n                has_audio = True\n    except Exception:\n        pass\n\n    print(\"배경음: \" + bgm_name)\n    print(\"나레이션 %d 개를 제자리에 놓았습니다.\" % placed)\n    print(\"소리 파일: \" + apath)\n    print(\"영상: \" + out)\n    if dur:\n        print(\"길이 %.2f초 (예상 %.2f초) / 소리 %s\" % (dur, total, \"있음\" if has_audio else \"없음\"))\n    if not has_audio:\n        print(\"[검사 미통과] 소리가 들어가지 않았습니다.\")\n        return 1\n\n    # MN_NEWSCARD_MIX_MAP_V1 : 소리길이 있다는 것만으로는 부족하다.\n    # 결과물에서 소리를 도로 꺼내 실제 크기를 잰다. 무음이면 미통과.\n    loud = -1\n    try:\n        chk = os.path.join(os.path.dirname(apath), \"_verify.wav\")\n        subprocess.run([_ffmpeg(), \"-y\", \"-nostdin\", \"-i\", out,\n                        \"-ac\", \"1\", \"-ar\", str(RATE), chk],\n                       capture_output=True, timeout=600)\n        vf = wave.open(chk, \"rb\")\n        try:\n            nn = vf.getnframes()\n            raw = vf.readframes(min(nn, RATE * 30))\n        finally:\n            vf.close()\n        vals = struct.unpack(\"<%dh\" % (len(raw) // 2), raw) if raw else ()\n        loud = max(abs(v) for v in vals) if vals else 0\n        try:\n            os.remove(chk)\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(\"  소리 크기를 재지 못했습니다: \" + str(e)[:80])\n\n    if loud == 0:\n        print(\"[검사 미통과] 소리길은 있으나 아무 소리도 나지 않습니다(무음).\")\n        return 1\n    if 0 < loud < 300:\n        print(\"[검사 미통과] 소리가 거의 들리지 않습니다 (가장 큰 값 %d).\" % loud)\n        return 1\n    if loud > 0:\n        print(\"실제 소리 크기: 가장 큰 값 %d (최대 32767 기준 %.1f%%)\"\n              % (loud, loud * 100.0 / 32767))\n    if dur and abs(dur - total) > 2.0:\n        print(\"[검사 미통과] 길이가 %0.2f초나 어긋납니다.\" % abs(dur - total))\n        return 1\n    print(\"[DONE] 소리를 얹었습니다.\")\n    return 0\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    sys.exit(main())\n", "scripts/motion.py": "# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n# MN_NEWSCARD_MOTION_V1\n# 뉴스 한 건 -> 움직이는 카드(MP4) + 커버 이미지(PNG)\n# 글꼴은 설치하지 않고 파일 경로로 직접 지정한다. 사진은 펙셀/언스플래시에서 받아 톤을 입힌다.\nimport os, sys, json, math, random, datetime, sqlite3, subprocess, shutil\nimport urllib.request, urllib.parse, hashlib, re\n\nFONT_DIR = r\"C:\\Mynerd_tools\\fonts\"\nFFMPEG = r\"C:\\Mynerd_tools\\bin\\ffmpeg.exe\"\nCACHE = r\"C:\\Mynerd_tools\\cache\\photos\"\n\nCREAM = (234, 231, 223)\nINK = (13, 13, 13)\n\nPALETTES = {\n    \"lime\":   {\"accent\": (185, 227, 75),  \"deep\": (76, 107, 27),  \"on_accent\": INK},\n    \"orange\": {\"accent\": (240, 122, 33),  \"deep\": (138, 58, 12),  \"on_accent\": INK},\n    \"violet\": {\"accent\": (124, 92, 224),  \"deep\": (59, 42, 120),  \"on_accent\": (255, 255, 255)},\n    \"teal\":   {\"accent\": (31, 181, 140),  \"deep\": (12, 84, 67),   \"on_accent\": INK},\n    \"coral\":  {\"accent\": (228, 87, 61),   \"deep\": (126, 34, 20),  \"on_accent\": (255, 255, 255)},\n}\n\nHAN = re.compile(r\"[\\uac00-\\ud7a3\\u3131-\\u318e]\")\n\nSHAPES = {\n    \"tall\":   {\"w\": 1080, \"h\": 1350},\n    \"square\": {\"w\": 1080, \"h\": 1080},\n    \"story\":  {\"w\": 1080, \"h\": 1920},\n}\n\n\n# MN_NEWSCARD_MOTION_V2\ndef _unquote(v):\n    v = (\"\" if v is None else str(v)).strip()\n    if len(v) >= 2 and v[0] == v[-1] and v[0] in ('\"', \"'\"):\n        v = v[1:-1]\n    return v.replace(\"\\\\\\\\\", \"\\\\\").strip()\n\n\ndef cfg(key):\n    for db in (r\"C:\\Mynerd\\config.db\",\n               os.path.join(os.environ.get(\"LOCALAPPDATA\", \"\"), \"mynerd\", \"config.db\")):\n        try:\n            if not os.path.isfile(db):\n                continue\n            con = sqlite3.connect(db)\n            try:\n                r = con.execute(\"SELECT value FROM config WHERE key=?\", (key,)).fetchone()\n                if r and str(r[0]).strip():\n                    return _unquote(r[0])\n            finally:\n                con.close()\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n    return \"\"\n\n\ndef out_root():\n    v = cfg(\"SYSTEM.out_root\")\n    if v:\n        return v\n    return os.path.join(os.path.expanduser(\"~\"), \"Documents\", \"MYNERD\")\n\n\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw, ImageFont, ImageFilter, ImageEnhance\n\n_FCACHE = {}\n\n\ndef font(kind, size, text=\"\"):\n    han = bool(HAN.search(text or \"\"))\n    if han:\n        name = {\"title\": \"Pretendard-Black.ttf\", \"body\": \"Pretendard-Medium.ttf\",\n                \"label\": \"Pretendard-Bold.ttf\", \"mono\": \"Pretendard-Bold.ttf\",\n                \"num\": \"Pretendard-Black.ttf\"}.get(kind, \"Pretendard-Medium.ttf\")\n    else:\n        name = {\"title\": \"ArchivoBlack-Regular.ttf\", \"body\": \"Archivo-Variable.ttf\",\n                \"label\": \"SpaceMono-Bold.ttf\", \"mono\": \"SpaceMono-Regular.ttf\",\n                \"num\": \"ArchivoBlack-Regular.ttf\"}.get(kind, \"Archivo-Variable.ttf\")\n    key = (name, int(size))\n    if key in _FCACHE:\n        return _FCACHE[key]\n    try:\n        f = ImageFont.truetype(os.path.join(FONT_DIR, name), int(size))\n    except Exception:\n        try:\n            f = ImageFont.truetype(os.path.join(r\"C:\\Windows\\Fonts\", \"malgunbd.ttf\"), int(size))\n        except Exception:\n            f = ImageFont.load_default()\n    _FCACHE[key] = f\n    return f\n\n\ndef ease(t):\n    t = max(0.0, min(1.0, t))\n    return 1 - pow(1 - t, 3)\n\n\ndef seg(p, a, b):\n    if b <= a:\n        return 1.0 if p >= b else 0.0\n    return max(0.0, min(1.0, (p - a) / (b - a)))\n\n\ndef mix(c1, c2, k):\n    k = max(0.0, min(1.0, k))\n    return tuple(int(c1[i] + (c2[i] - c1[i]) * k) for i in range(3))\n\n\ndef wrap(draw, text, fnt, maxw):\n    words = str(text).split()\n    if not words:\n        return []\n    lines = []\n    cur = words[0]\n    for w in words[1:]:\n        if draw.textlength(cur + \" \" + w, font=fnt) <= maxw:\n            cur = cur + \" \" + w\n        else:\n            lines.append(cur)\n            cur = w\n    lines.append(cur)\n    return lines\n\n\n# ---------- 사진 ----------\n\ndef _cache_path(url):\n    h = hashlib.sha1(url.encode(\"utf-8\")).hexdigest()[:20]\n    return os.path.join(CACHE, h + \".jpg\")\n\n\ndef _get(url, headers=None, timeout=40):\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=headers or {\"User-Agent\": \"mynerd-card/1.0\"})\n    with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=timeout) as r:\n        return r.read()\n\n\ndef _mn_base():\n    p = cfg(\"SYSTEM.KAI_PORT\") or os.environ.get(\"KAI_PORT\") or \"8765\"\n    p = \"\".join(ch for ch in str(p) if ch.isdigit()) or \"8765\"\n    return \"http://127.0.0.1:\" + p\n\n\ndef _profile_ready(name):\n    \"\"\"그 연결에 열쇠가 들어 있는지 먼저 본다. MN_NEWSCARD_PHOTO_FAST_V1\"\"\"\n    try:\n        rq = urllib.request.Request(_mn_base() + \"/net/profiles\")\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(rq, timeout=6) as r:\n            d = json.loads(r.read().decode(\"utf-8\"))\n        items = d.get(\"items\") if isinstance(d, dict) else d\n        for it in (items or []):\n            if str(it.get(\"name\")) == name:\n                return bool(it.get(\"secret_keys\"))\n    except Exception:\n        return False\n    return False\n\n\ndef _via_profile(profile, path):\n    \"\"\"등록된 '연결'을 거쳐 부른다. 열쇠는 서버가 붙인다. 없으면 None.\"\"\"\n    if not _profile_ready(profile):\n        return None\n    payload = json.dumps({\"profile\": profile, \"path\": path, \"method\": \"GET\",\n                          \"headers\": {\"Accept\": \"application/json\"}}).encode(\"utf-8\")\n    rq = urllib.request.Request(_mn_base() + \"/net/fetch\", method=\"POST\", data=payload,\n                                headers={\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"})\n    with urllib.request.urlopen(rq, timeout=45) as r:\n        out = json.loads(r.read().decode(\"utf-8\"))\n    if not out.get(\"ok\"):\n        err = out.get(\"error\") or \"\"\n        if err in (\"needs_auth\", \"no_profile\"):\n            return None\n        raise ValueError(err or (\"status \" + str(out.get(\"status\"))))\n    body = out.get(\"body\") or \"\"\n    return json.loads(body) if isinstance(body, str) else body\n\n\ndef fetch_photo(query, orient, log):\n    if not query:\n        return None\n    if not os.path.isdir(CACHE):\n        try:\n            os.makedirs(CACHE)\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n\n    # MN_NEWSCARD_PHOTO_NETPROF_V1\n    q = urllib.parse.quote(query)\n    pk = uk = \"\"\n\n    for prof, path, kind in (\n            (\"펙셀 사진\", \"/v1/search?query=%s&per_page=15&orientation=%s\" % (q, orient), \"pexels\"),\n            (\"언스플래시 사진\", \"/search/photos?query=%s&per_page=15&orientation=%s\"\n             % (q, \"portrait\" if orient == \"portrait\" else \"squarish\"), \"unsplash\")):\n        try:\n            d = _via_profile(prof, path)\n            if not d:\n                continue\n            if kind == \"pexels\":\n                ph = d.get(\"photos\") or []\n                if not ph:\n                    log.append(\"펙셀에서 검색 결과가 없었습니다: \" + query)\n                    continue\n                pick = ph[random.randrange(0, min(8, len(ph)))]\n                s = pick.get(\"src\") or {}\n                url = s.get(\"large2x\") or s.get(\"large\") or s.get(\"original\")\n                author = pick.get(\"photographer\") or \"\"\n                link = pick.get(\"url\") or \"\"\n                site = \"PEXELS\"\n            else:\n                rs = d.get(\"results\") or []\n                if not rs:\n                    log.append(\"언스플래시에서 검색 결과가 없었습니다: \" + query)\n                    continue\n                pick = rs[random.randrange(0, min(8, len(rs)))]\n                url = (pick.get(\"urls\") or {}).get(\"regular\")\n                author = ((pick.get(\"user\") or {}).get(\"name\") or \"\")\n                link = ((pick.get(\"links\") or {}).get(\"html\") or \"\")\n                site = \"UNSPLASH\"\n            if not url:\n                continue\n            cp = _cache_path(url)\n            if not os.path.isfile(cp):\n                with open(cp, \"wb\") as f:\n                    f.write(_get(url))\n            return {\"path\": cp, \"author\": author, \"site\": site, \"link\": link}\n        except Exception as e:\n            log.append(\"%s 실패: %s\" % (prof, repr(e)[:100]))\n\n    # MN_NEWSCARD_PHOTO_OPENVERSE_V1 - 열쇠 없이 되는 곳. 자유 이용 사진만 고른다\n    try:\n        u = (\"https://api.openverse.org/v1/images/?q=\" + q\n             + \"&license=cc0,pdm&page_size=20&mature=false\"\n             + (\"&aspect_ratio=tall\" if orient == \"portrait\" else \"&aspect_ratio=square\"))\n        d = json.loads(_get(u, {\"User-Agent\": \"mynerd-card/1.0 (contact: mynerd.io)\",\n                                \"Accept\": \"application/json\"}, timeout=30).decode(\"utf-8\"))\n        rs = [r for r in (d.get(\"results\") or []) if r.get(\"url\")]\n        if rs:\n            pick = rs[random.randrange(0, min(10, len(rs)))]\n            src_u = pick.get(\"url\")\n            cp = _cache_path(src_u)\n            if not os.path.isfile(cp):\n                raw = _get(src_u, {\"User-Agent\": \"mynerd-card/1.0\"}, timeout=60)\n                if len(raw) < 8000:\n                    raise ValueError(\"받은 그림이 너무 작습니다\")\n                with open(cp, \"wb\") as f:\n                    f.write(raw)\n            return {\"path\": cp, \"author\": (pick.get(\"creator\") or \"\"),\n                    \"site\": \"OPENVERSE\", \"link\": pick.get(\"foreign_landing_url\") or \"\"}\n        log.append(\"오픈버스에서 검색 결과가 없었습니다: \" + query)\n    except Exception as e:\n        log.append(\"오픈버스 실패: \" + repr(e)[:120])\n\n    if not pk and not uk:\n        log.append(\"사진 열쇠가 없어 자유 이용 사진만 찾았습니다.\")\n    return None\n\n\ndef tone(img, pal, W, H):\n    \"\"\"사진을 먹색-강조색 두 색조로 바꾼다. 브랜드 톤 유지.\"\"\"\n    bw = int(W * 1.22)\n    bh = int(H * 1.22)\n    src = img.convert(\"RGB\")\n    sw, sh = src.size\n    k = max(bw / float(sw), bh / float(sh))\n    src = src.resize((max(1, int(sw * k)), max(1, int(sh * k))), Image.LANCZOS)\n    sw, sh = src.size\n    left = (sw - bw) // 2\n    top = (sh - bh) // 2\n    src = src.crop((left, top, left + bw, top + bh))\n\n    g = src.convert(\"L\")\n    g = ImageEnhance.Contrast(g).enhance(1.35)\n    lut = []\n    dark = mix(INK, (0, 0, 0), 0.25)\n    for i in range(256):\n        v = i / 255.0\n        if v < 0.55:\n            c = mix(dark, pal[\"deep\"], v / 0.55)\n        else:\n            c = mix(pal[\"deep\"], pal[\"accent\"], (v - 0.55) / 0.45)\n        lut.append(c)\n    out = Image.new(\"RGB\", g.size)\n    px = g.load()\n    op = out.load()\n    for yy in range(g.size[1]):\n        for xx in range(g.size[0]):\n            op[xx, yy] = lut[px[xx, yy]]\n    return out\n\n\ndef tone_fast(img, pal, W, H):\n    \"\"\"색 매핑을 채널 단위로 처리해 빠르게 한다.\"\"\"\n    bw = int(W * 1.22)\n    bh = int(H * 1.22)\n    src = img.convert(\"RGB\")\n    sw, sh = src.size\n    k = max(bw / float(sw), bh / float(sh))\n    src = src.resize((max(1, int(sw * k)), max(1, int(sh * k))), Image.LANCZOS)\n    sw, sh = src.size\n    left = (sw - bw) // 2\n    top = (sh - bh) // 2\n    src = src.crop((left, top, left + bw, top + bh))\n\n    # MN_NEWSCARD_TONE_INK_V1 - 강조색을 사진에 쓰지 않는다. 먹색에서 밝은 회색까지만.\n    g = src.convert(\"L\")\n    g = ImageEnhance.Contrast(g).enhance(1.28)\n    lo = (10, 10, 11)\n    hi = (176, 174, 168)\n    tabs = []\n    for ch in range(3):\n        t = []\n        for i in range(256):\n            v = (i / 255.0) ** 1.06\n            t.append(int(max(0, min(255, lo[ch] + (hi[ch] - lo[ch]) * v))))\n        tabs.append(t)\n    out = Image.merge(\"RGB\", (g.point(tabs[0]), g.point(tabs[1]), g.point(tabs[2])))\n    return shade(out)\n\n\ndef shade(im):\n    \"\"\"위아래로 어두워지는 결을 얹어 글자가 뜨게 한다. MN_NEWSCARD_TONE_INK_V1\"\"\"\n    w, h = im.size\n    lay = Image.new(\"L\", (1, h))\n    px = lay.load()\n    for y in range(h):\n        v = y / float(max(1, h - 1))\n        top = max(0.0, 1.0 - v / 0.42) ** 1.4\n        bot = max(0.0, (v - 0.52) / 0.48) ** 1.2\n        a = 0.30 + 0.42 * top + 0.46 * bot\n        px[0, y] = int(max(0, min(255, a * 255)))\n    mask = lay.resize((w, h))\n    dark = Image.new(\"RGB\", (w, h), (8, 8, 9))\n    return Image.composite(dark, im, mask)\n\n\ndef made_bg(W, H, pal, rnd):\n    \"\"\"사진이 없을 때 코드로 그리는 배경.\"\"\"\n    bw = int(W * 1.22)\n    bh = int(H * 1.22)\n    im = Image.new(\"RGB\", (bw, bh), mix(INK, (0, 0, 0), 0.2))\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(im, \"RGBA\")\n    step = 46\n    for i in range(-bh, bw, step):\n        a = 30 + rnd.randrange(0, 26)\n        d.line([(i, 0), (i + bh, bh)], fill=pal[\"deep\"] + (a,), width=2)\n    for i in range(6):\n        x = rnd.randrange(0, bw)\n        y = rnd.randrange(0, bh)\n        s = rnd.randrange(120, 340)\n        d.polygon([(x, y), (x + s, y + rnd.randrange(-40, 40)),\n                   (x + s - rnd.randrange(20, 90), y + s),\n                   (x - rnd.randrange(0, 60), y + s - rnd.randrange(20, 80))],\n                  fill=pal[\"deep\"] + (rnd.randrange(40, 90),))\n    for i in range(3):\n        cx = rnd.randrange(0, bw)\n        cy = rnd.randrange(0, bh)\n        for r in range(60, 420, 34):\n            d.ellipse([cx - r, cy - r, cx + r, cy + r],\n                      outline=pal[\"accent\"] + (26,), width=2)\n    return im.filter(ImageFilter.GaussianBlur(0.6))\n\n\ndef grid_layer(W, H, pal):\n    lay = Image.new(\"RGBA\", (W, H), (0, 0, 0, 0))\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(lay)\n    step = 30\n    for y in range(0, H, step):\n        for x in range(0, W, step):\n            d.point((x, y), fill=CREAM + (26,))\n    for y in range(0, H, 3):\n        d.line([(0, y), (W, y)], fill=(0, 0, 0, 16))\n    return lay\n\n\n# ---------- 한 장 그리기 ----------\n\ndef draw_frame(p, ctx):\n    W = ctx[\"W\"]\n    H = ctx[\"H\"]\n    pal = ctx[\"pal\"]\n    d0 = ctx[\"data\"]\n    M = ctx[\"M\"]\n    base = ctx[\"base\"]\n\n    bw, bh = base.size\n    k = 1.0 - 0.10 * ease(p)\n    cw = int(W * k * (bw / float(W)) / 1.22 * 1.22)\n    cw = int(bw * k)\n    ch = int(bh * k)\n    px = int((bw - cw) * (0.5 + 0.06 * math.sin(p * 1.4)))\n    py = int((bh - ch) * (0.5 - 0.05 * p))\n    im = base.crop((px, py, px + cw, py + ch)).resize((W, H), Image.BILINEAR).convert(\"RGB\")\n\n    ov = Image.new(\"RGBA\", (W, H), INK + (int(255 * 0.62),))\n    im = Image.alpha_composite(im.convert(\"RGBA\"), ov)\n    im = Image.alpha_composite(im, ctx[\"grid\"])\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(im, \"RGBA\")\n\n    ac = pal[\"accent\"]\n\n    # 왼쪽 강조 띠\n    g = ease(seg(p, 0.0, 0.30))\n    d.rectangle([0, 0, 13, int(H * g)], fill=ac + (255,))\n\n    # 키커 배지\n    g = ease(seg(p, 0.04, 0.28))\n    if g > 0:\n        kick = (d0.get(\"kicker\") or \"\").upper()\n        kick2 = (d0.get(\"kicker2\") or \"\").upper()\n        f = font(\"label\", ctx[\"s_kick\"], kick)\n        tw = d.textlength(kick, font=f)\n        bwid = int(tw + 44)\n        bx = M - int((1 - g) * 240)\n        by = ctx[\"y_kick\"]\n        bh2 = ctx[\"s_kick\"] + 26\n        a = int(255 * g)\n        d.rectangle([bx, by, bx + bwid, by + bh2], fill=ac + (a,))\n        d.text((bx + 22, by + bh2 // 2), kick, font=f, fill=pal[\"on_accent\"] + (a,), anchor=\"lm\")\n        if kick2:\n            f2 = font(\"label\", ctx[\"s_kick\"], kick2)\n            d.text((bx + bwid + 20, by + bh2 // 2), kick2, font=f2,\n                   fill=CREAM + (int(200 * g),), anchor=\"lm\")\n\n    # 헤드라인\n    y = ctx[\"y_head\"]\n    for idx, txt in enumerate([d0.get(\"headline1\") or \"\", d0.get(\"headline2\") or \"\"]):\n        if not txt:\n            continue\n        a0 = 0.14 + idx * 0.10\n        g = ease(seg(p, a0, a0 + 0.26))\n        if g <= 0:\n            y += ctx[\"lh_head\"]\n            continue\n        f = font(\"title\", ctx[\"s_head\"], txt)\n        off = int((1 - g) * 46)\n        d.text((M, y + off), txt, font=f, fill=CREAM + (int(255 * g),))\n        y += ctx[\"lh_head\"]\n\n    # 구분선\n    g = ease(seg(p, 0.38, 0.54))\n    if g > 0:\n        ly = y + 26\n        d.rectangle([M, ly, M + int((W - M * 2) * g), ly + 5], fill=ac + (255,))\n\n    # 부제\n    g = ease(seg(p, 0.44, 0.62))\n    if g > 0:\n        sf = d0.get(\"standfirst\") or \"\"\n        f = font(\"body\", ctx[\"s_sub\"], sf)\n        yy = y + 26 + 40\n        for ln in wrap(d, sf, f, W - M * 2)[:3]:\n            d.text((M, yy), ln, font=f, fill=CREAM + (int(226 * g),))\n            yy += int(ctx[\"s_sub\"] * 1.42)\n\n    # 큰 숫자\n    big = str(d0.get(\"big\") or \"\")\n    if big:\n        g = ease(seg(p, 0.54, 0.80))\n        if g > 0:\n            digits = \"\".join(c for c in big if c.isdigit())\n            if digits and len(digits) <= 6:\n                cur = int(int(digits) * g)\n                show = big.replace(digits, str(cur), 1)\n            else:\n                show = big\n            f = font(\"num\", ctx[\"s_big\"], show)\n            by = ctx[\"y_big\"]\n            d.text((M, by), show, font=f, fill=ac + (int(255 * min(1.0, g * 1.6)),))\n            tw = d.textlength(show, font=f)\n            l1 = d0.get(\"big_line1\") or \"\"\n            l2 = d0.get(\"big_line2\") or \"\"\n            g2 = ease(seg(p, 0.66, 0.84))\n            if g2 > 0 and (l1 or l2):\n                fl = font(\"mono\", ctx[\"s_note\"], l1 + l2)\n                d.text((M + tw + 30, by + int(ctx[\"s_big\"] * 0.30)), l1, font=fl,\n                       fill=CREAM + (int(210 * g2),))\n                d.text((M + tw + 30, by + int(ctx[\"s_big\"] * 0.30) + int(ctx[\"s_note\"] * 1.5)),\n                       l2, font=fl, fill=CREAM + (int(210 * g2),))\n\n    # 스탬프\n    stamp = (d0.get(\"stamp\") or \"\").upper()\n    if stamp:\n        g = seg(p, 0.80, 0.90)\n        if g > 0:\n            sc = 1.0 + 0.35 * (1 - ease(g))\n            f = font(\"label\", ctx[\"s_stamp\"], stamp)\n            tw = int(d.textlength(stamp, font=f))\n            pad = 20\n            lw, lh2 = tw + pad * 2, ctx[\"s_stamp\"] + pad * 2\n            lay = Image.new(\"RGBA\", (lw + 8, lh2 + 8), (0, 0, 0, 0))\n            ld = ImageDraw.Draw(lay)\n            ld.rectangle([4, 4, lw, lh2], outline=ac + (255,), width=4)\n            ld.text((4 + pad, 4 + lh2 // 2), stamp, font=f, fill=ac + (255,), anchor=\"lm\")\n            lay = lay.rotate(-4, expand=True, resample=Image.BICUBIC)\n            if sc != 1.0:\n                lay = lay.resize((int(lay.width * sc), int(lay.height * sc)), Image.BICUBIC)\n            im.alpha_composite(lay, (M, ctx[\"y_stamp\"] - lay.height // 2))\n            d = ImageDraw.Draw(im, \"RGBA\")\n\n    # 아래 띠\n    g = ease(seg(p, 0.10, 0.30))\n    if g > 0:\n        by = H - ctx[\"foot\"]\n        d.rectangle([0, by, W, by + 2], fill=CREAM + (int(60 * g),))\n        f = font(\"mono\", ctx[\"s_foot\"], \"\")\n        src_t = (d0.get(\"source\") or \"\").upper()\n        cred = ctx.get(\"credit_text\") or \"\"\n        left_t = src_t if not cred else (src_t + \"   \" + cred if src_t else cred)\n        d.text((M, by + ctx[\"foot\"] // 2), left_t[:64], font=f,\n               fill=CREAM + (int(150 * g),), anchor=\"lm\")\n        issue = (d0.get(\"issue\") or \"\").upper()\n        d.text((W - M, by + ctx[\"foot\"] // 2), issue, font=f,\n               fill=CREAM + (int(150 * g),), anchor=\"rm\")\n        fm = font(\"label\", ctx[\"s_foot\"] + 4, \"\")\n        d.text((W - M, by - 34), \"MYNERD\", font=fm, fill=ac + (int(230 * g),), anchor=\"rm\")\n\n    return im.convert(\"RGB\")\n\n\ndef layout(shape, W, H):\n    tall = H > W\n    M = 88\n    if shape == \"square\":\n        return {\"M\": M, \"y_kick\": 84, \"s_kick\": 26, \"y_head\": 210, \"s_head\": 92,\n                \"lh_head\": 104, \"s_sub\": 34, \"s_big\": 150, \"y_big\": H - 330,\n                \"s_note\": 24, \"s_stamp\": 26, \"y_stamp\": H - 168, \"foot\": 88, \"s_foot\": 22}\n    if shape == \"story\":\n        return {\"M\": M, \"y_kick\": 150, \"s_kick\": 30, \"y_head\": 420, \"s_head\": 118,\n                \"lh_head\": 134, \"s_sub\": 40, \"s_big\": 210, \"y_big\": H - 620,\n                \"s_note\": 28, \"s_stamp\": 30, \"y_stamp\": H - 360, \"foot\": 120, \"s_foot\": 26}\n    return {\"M\": M, \"y_kick\": 104, \"s_kick\": 28, \"y_head\": 300, \"s_head\": 106,\n            \"lh_head\": 120, \"s_sub\": 38, \"s_big\": 180, \"y_big\": H - 470,\n            \"s_note\": 26, \"s_stamp\": 28, \"y_stamp\": H - 250, \"foot\": 104, \"s_foot\": 24}\n\n\n# MN_NEWSCARD_MOTION_V3 / MN_NEWSCARD_MOTION_V4\ndef check_video(path):\n    \"\"\"실제로 재생 가능한 파일인지 본다. 길이와 화면 크기를 읽어 확인한다.\"\"\"\n    if not os.path.isfile(path):\n        return False, \"파일이 없습니다\"\n    if os.path.getsize(path) < 20000:\n        return False, \"파일이 너무 작습니다\"\n    probe = os.path.join(os.path.dirname(FFMPEG), \"ffprobe.exe\")\n    try:\n        if os.path.isfile(probe):\n            cmd = [probe, \"-v\", \"error\", \"-show_entries\",\n                   \"format=duration:stream=codec_type,width,height\",\n                   \"-of\", \"default=noprint_wrappers=1\", path]\n        else:\n            cmd = [FFMPEG, \"-v\", \"error\", \"-i\", path, \"-f\", \"null\", \"-\"]\n        r = subprocess.run(cmd, capture_output=True, text=True,\n                           errors=\"replace\", timeout=120,\n                           stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL)\n        txt = ((r.stdout or \"\") + (r.stderr or \"\")).strip()\n        if r.returncode != 0:\n            return False, (txt[:200] or \"검사 도구가 오류를 냈습니다\")\n        dur = \"\"\n        wid = \"\"\n        hei = \"\"\n        for ln in txt.splitlines():\n            if ln.startswith(\"duration=\"):\n                dur = ln.split(\"=\", 1)[1].strip()\n            elif ln.startswith(\"width=\"):\n                wid = ln.split(\"=\", 1)[1].strip()\n            elif ln.startswith(\"height=\"):\n                hei = ln.split(\"=\", 1)[1].strip()\n        if dur:\n            try:\n                if float(dur) < 0.5:\n                    return False, \"길이가 0에 가깝습니다\"\n            except Exception:\n                pass\n            return True, \"길이 %s초 / 화면 %sx%s\" % (dur[:5], wid or \"?\", hei or \"?\")\n        return True, \"재생 가능 확인\"\n    except Exception as e:\n        return False, repr(e)[:160]\n\n\ndef main():\n    raw = \"\"\n    if len(sys.argv) > 1 and os.path.isfile(sys.argv[1]):\n        raw = open(sys.argv[1], encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\").read()\n    elif os.path.isfile(\"input.txt\"):\n        raw = open(\"input.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\").read()\n    raw = raw.strip()\n    if not raw:\n        print(\"[오류] 입력이 비었습니다. JSON 한 덩이를 주세요.\")\n        return\n    try:\n        d0 = json.loads(raw)\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(\"[오류] JSON 을 읽지 못했습니다: \" + repr(e))\n        return\n\n    # MN_NEWSCARD_MOTION_V5\n    if d0.get(\"skip\"):\n        print(\"[건너뜀] \" + (d0.get(\"skip_reason\") or \"이번에는 만들 것이 없습니다.\"))\n        return\n\n    log = []\n    shape = (d0.get(\"shape\") or \"tall\").lower()\n    if shape not in SHAPES:\n        shape = \"tall\"\n    W = SHAPES[shape][\"w\"]\n    H = SHAPES[shape][\"h\"]\n    pal = PALETTES.get((d0.get(\"palette\") or \"lime\").lower()) or PALETTES[\"lime\"]\n    seed = int(d0.get(\"seed\") or 7)\n    rnd = random.Random(seed)\n\n    fps = int(d0.get(\"fps\") or 24)\n    fps = max(12, min(30, fps))\n    secs = float(d0.get(\"seconds\") or 6)\n    secs = max(3.0, min(15.0, secs))\n    total = int(fps * secs)\n\n    outdir = d0.get(\"out\") or os.path.join(out_root(), \"images\", \"cardnews\", \"motion\")\n    if not os.path.isdir(outdir):\n        os.makedirs(outdir)\n\n    orient = \"portrait\" if H > W else \"square\"\n    photo = fetch_photo(d0.get(\"photo_query\") or \"\", orient, log)\n    credit_text = \"\"\n    if photo:\n        try:\n            base = tone_fast(Image.open(photo[\"path\"]), pal, W, H)\n            credit_text = (\"PHOTO \" + (photo.get(\"author\") or \"\") + \" / \" +\n                           photo.get(\"site\", \"\")).strip().upper()\n        except Exception as e:\n            log.append(\"사진 가공 실패, 코드 배경으로 바꿉니다: \" + repr(e)[:120])\n            base = made_bg(W, H, pal, rnd)\n    else:\n        base = made_bg(W, H, pal, rnd)\n\n    ctx = layout(shape, W, H)\n    ctx.update({\"W\": W, \"H\": H, \"pal\": pal, \"data\": d0, \"base\": base,\n                \"grid\": grid_layer(W, H, pal), \"credit_text\": credit_text})\n\n    stamp = datetime.datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y%m%d_%H%M%S\")\n    tmp = os.path.join(outdir, \"_frames_\" + stamp)\n    os.makedirs(tmp)\n\n    hold = 0.14\n    last = None\n    for i in range(total):\n        t = i / float(max(1, total - 1))\n        p = min(1.0, t / (1.0 - hold))\n        fr = draw_frame(p, ctx)\n        fr.save(os.path.join(tmp, \"f_%04d.png\" % (i + 1)))\n        last = fr\n\n    cover = os.path.join(outdir, \"card_%s_%s_cover.png\" % (stamp, shape))\n    if last is not None:\n        last.save(cover)\n\n    mp4 = os.path.join(outdir, \"card_%s_%s.mp4\" % (stamp, shape))\n    made = False\n    if os.path.isfile(FFMPEG):\n        cmd = [FFMPEG, \"-y\", \"-nostdin\", \"-hide_banner\", \"-loglevel\", \"error\",\n               \"-framerate\", str(fps), \"-i\", os.path.join(tmp, \"f_%04d.png\"),\n               \"-f\", \"lavfi\", \"-t\", (\"%.2f\" % secs),\n               \"-i\", \"anullsrc=channel_layout=stereo:sample_rate=44100\",\n               \"-shortest\",\n               \"-c:v\", \"libx264\", \"-profile:v\", \"high\", \"-pix_fmt\", \"yuv420p\",\n               \"-crf\", \"20\", \"-c:a\", \"aac\", \"-b:a\", \"64k\",\n               \"-movflags\", \"+faststart\", mp4]\n        try:\n            r = subprocess.run(cmd, capture_output=True, text=True,\n                               errors=\"replace\", timeout=600,\n                               stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL)\n            if r.returncode == 0 and os.path.isfile(mp4):\n                made = True\n                ok, why = check_video(mp4)\n                if not ok:\n                    made = False\n                    log.append('만든 영상이 검사를 통과하지 못했습니다: ' + why)\n                else:\n                    log.append('검사 통과 - ' + why)\n            else:\n                log.append(\"ffmpeg 실패: \" + (r.stderr or \"\")[:300])\n        except Exception as e:\n            log.append(\"ffmpeg 실행 실패: \" + repr(e)[:200])\n    else:\n        log.append(\"ffmpeg 를 찾지 못했습니다: \" + FFMPEG)\n\n    if made:\n        try:\n            shutil.rmtree(tmp)\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n\n    if photo:\n        try:\n            with open(os.path.join(outdir, \"사진 출처.txt\"), \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n                f.write(\"%s\\t%s\\t%s\\t%s\\t%s\\n\" % (\n                    stamp, os.path.basename(mp4), photo.get(\"site\", \"\"),\n                    photo.get(\"author\", \"\"), photo.get(\"link\", \"\")))\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n\n    print(\"모양: %s  %dx%d   %.1f초 %dfps (%d장)\" % (shape, W, H, secs, fps, total))\n    print(\"배경: \" + (\"사진 \" + (photo.get(\"site\") or \"\") + \" / \" + (photo.get(\"author\") or \"\")\n                    if photo else \"코드로 그린 배경\"))\n    if made:\n        print(\"영상: \" + mp4)\n    else:\n        print(\"영상: 만들지 못했습니다. 낱장은 여기 있습니다: \" + tmp)\n    print(\"커버: \" + cover)\n    for s in log:\n        print(\"  - \" + s)\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n", "scripts/narrate.py": "# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"MN_NEWSCARD_NARRATE_V1 - 장면별 나레이션을 굽고 장면 길이를 소리에 맞춘다.\n\n쓰는 법:\n    python narrate.py <작업서식.json> [내보낼 폴더]\n\n작업 서식의 각 장면에 narration 칸을 적어 두면 그 문장을 읽는다.\nnarration 이 없는 장면은 소리 없이 원래 길이를 지킨다.\n\n내놓는 것:\n    <폴더>/narr_XX.wav      장면별 소리\n    <폴더>/_job_timed.json  장면 길이를 소리에 맞춘 새 작업 서식\n    <폴더>/_narration.json  장면별 소리 파일·길이·시작 시각\n\"\"\"\nimport os\nimport sys\nimport json\nimport wave\nimport datetime\n\nMODEL = r\"C:\\Mynerd_tools\\tts\\supertonic3\"\n\nLEAD = 0.35      # 장면이 시작하고 말이 시작되기까지 두는 사이\nTAIL = 0.55      # 말이 끝나고 장면이 넘어가기까지 두는 사이\nMIN_SEC = 2.2    # 아무리 짧아도 이만큼은 보여준다\nMAX_SEC = 12.0   # 영상 쪽 상한과 같다\n\n\ndef _save_wav(path, arr, rate):\n    import numpy as np\n    x = np.asarray(arr).squeeze()\n    if x.dtype != np.int16:\n        x = (np.clip(x, -1.0, 1.0) * 32767).astype(np.int16)\n    f = wave.open(path, \"wb\")\n    try:\n        f.setnchannels(1)\n        f.setsampwidth(2)\n        f.setframerate(int(rate))\n        f.writeframes(x.tobytes())\n    finally:\n        f.close()\n    return len(x) / float(rate)\n\n\ndef _synth(tts, style, text, lang):\n    \"\"\"돌려받는 두 값 중 개수가 많은 쪽이 소리, 하나뿐인 쪽이 초당 진동수다.\"\"\"\n    import numpy as np\n    a, b = tts.synthesize(text, style, lang=lang)\n    A = np.asarray(a)\n    B = np.asarray(b)\n    if A.size > B.size:\n        wav, rate_v = A, B\n    else:\n        wav, rate_v = B, A\n    rate = int(np.asarray(rate_v).ravel()[0]) if np.asarray(rate_v).size else 44100\n    if rate < 4000 or rate > 96000:\n        rate = 44100\n    return wav, rate\n\n\n# MN_NEWSCARD_AUTOCHAIN_V1 - 인자 없이도 앞 걸음의 산출물을 스스로 찾는다\n_MN_BASE = r\"C:\\Users\\fugus\\Documents\\MYNERD\\images\\cardnews\\story\"\n\n\ndef _mn_read_input_txt():\n    try:\n        if os.path.isfile(\"input.txt\"):\n            return open(\"input.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\").read().strip()\n    except Exception:\n        pass\n    return \"\"\n\n\ndef _mn_paths_in_text(text):\n    import re as _re\n    found = []\n    for ln in text.splitlines():\n        cands = [ln.strip()]\n        if \": \" in ln:\n            cands.append(ln.split(\": \", 1)[1].strip())\n        cands.extend(_re.split(r\"[\\s\\\"\\']+\", ln))\n        for c in cands:\n            c = c.strip().rstrip(\",\")\n            if len(c) > 3 and os.path.isfile(c) and c not in found:\n                found.append(c)\n    return found\n\n\ndef _mn_newest(patterns, skip_suffix=\"\"):\n    import glob as _glob\n    cands = []\n    for pat in patterns:\n        cands.extend(_glob.glob(pat))\n    cands = [p for p in cands if os.path.isfile(p)]\n    if skip_suffix:\n        cands = [p for p in cands if not p.lower().endswith(skip_suffix)]\n    if not cands:\n        return \"\"\n    return max(cands, key=os.path.getmtime)\n\n\ndef _mn_find_job():\n    raw = _mn_read_input_txt()\n    if raw:\n        if raw.lstrip().startswith(\"{\"):\n            try:\n                json.loads(raw)\n                base = _MN_BASE if os.path.isdir(_MN_BASE) else \".\"\n                stamp = datetime.datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y%m%d_%H%M%S\")\n                p = os.path.join(base, \"_job_input_\" + stamp + \".json\")\n                f = open(p, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n                try:\n                    f.write(raw)\n                finally:\n                    f.close()\n                return p\n            except Exception:\n                pass\n        for p in _mn_paths_in_text(raw):\n            if p.lower().endswith(\".json\"):\n                return p\n    return _mn_newest([os.path.join(_MN_BASE, \"_job*.json\"),\n                       os.path.join(_MN_BASE, \"*\", \"_job*.json\")])\n\n\ndef main():\n    job_path = \"\"\n    if len(sys.argv) >= 2 and os.path.isfile(sys.argv[1]):\n        try:\n            json.loads(open(sys.argv[1], encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\").read())\n            job_path = sys.argv[1]\n        except Exception:\n            job_path = \"\"\n    if not job_path:\n        job_path = _mn_find_job()\n    if not job_path:\n        print(\"[오류] 작업 서식을 찾지 못했습니다. 경로를 주거나 input.txt 에 서식(JSON) 또는 경로를 적어 주세요.\")\n        return 1\n    print(\"작업서식: \" + job_path)\n\n    f = open(job_path, encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\")\n    try:\n        job = json.loads(f.read())\n    finally:\n        f.close()\n\n    scenes = job.get(\"scenes\") or []\n    if not scenes:\n        print(\"[오류] 장면이 없습니다.\")\n        return 1\n\n    outdir = sys.argv[2] if len(sys.argv) > 2 else (job.get(\"out\") or os.path.dirname(job_path))\n    voice = str(job.get(\"voice\") or \"F1\")\n    lang = str(job.get(\"voice_lang\") or job.get(\"lang\") or \"en\")\n    stamp = datetime.datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y%m%d_%H%M%S\")\n    workdir = os.path.join(outdir, \"narration_\" + stamp)\n    if not os.path.isdir(workdir):\n        os.makedirs(workdir)\n\n    have = [i for i, s in enumerate(scenes) if str(s.get(\"narration\") or \"\").strip()]\n    if not have:\n        print(\"[건너뜀] 나레이션이 적힌 장면이 없습니다. 장면마다 narration 칸을 적어 주세요.\")\n        return 0\n\n    from supertonic import TTS\n    from supertonic.loader import load_voice_style_from_name\n\n    tts = TTS(model_dir=MODEL)\n    style = load_voice_style_from_name(MODEL, voice)\n    print(\"목소리 %s / 언어 %s / 나레이션 있는 장면 %d 개\" % (voice, lang, len(have)))\n    print(\"\")\n\n    items = []\n    cursor = 0.0\n    total_scene = 0.0\n    for idx, sc in enumerate(scenes):\n        text = str(sc.get(\"narration\") or \"\").strip()\n        base = float(sc.get(\"seconds\") or job.get(\"scene_seconds\") or 5)\n\n        if not text:\n            secs = max(MIN_SEC, min(MAX_SEC, base))\n            sc[\"seconds\"] = round(secs, 2)\n            items.append({\"scene\": idx + 1, \"wav\": \"\", \"voice_sec\": 0.0,\n                          \"start\": round(cursor, 2), \"scene_sec\": round(secs, 2)})\n            cursor += secs\n            total_scene += secs\n            print(\"[%d] 나레이션 없음 - %.2f초\" % (idx + 1, secs))\n            continue\n\n        wav, rate = _synth(tts, style, text, lang)\n        wp = os.path.join(workdir, \"narr_%02d.wav\" % (idx + 1))\n        vsec = _save_wav(wp, wav, rate)\n\n        secs = LEAD + vsec + TAIL\n        if secs < MIN_SEC:\n            secs = MIN_SEC\n        clipped = \"\"\n        if secs > MAX_SEC:\n            secs = MAX_SEC\n            clipped = \"  (상한에 걸려 잘렸습니다 - 문장을 줄이세요)\"\n        sc[\"seconds\"] = round(secs, 2)\n\n        items.append({\"scene\": idx + 1, \"wav\": wp, \"voice_sec\": round(vsec, 2),\n                      \"start\": round(cursor, 2), \"lead\": LEAD,\n                      \"scene_sec\": round(secs, 2), \"text\": text})\n        print(\"[%d] 말 %.2f초 -> 장면 %.2f초%s\" % (idx + 1, vsec, secs, clipped))\n        cursor += secs\n        total_scene += secs\n\n    job[\"scenes\"] = scenes\n    job_out = os.path.join(workdir, \"_job_timed.json\")\n    f = open(job_out, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    try:\n        f.write(json.dumps(job, ensure_ascii=False, indent=1))\n    finally:\n        f.close()\n\n    meta = {\"workdir\": workdir, \"voice\": voice, \"lang\": lang,\n            \"total_sec\": round(total_scene, 2), \"items\": items,\n            \"job_timed\": job_out}\n    meta_out = os.path.join(workdir, \"_narration.json\")\n    f = open(meta_out, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    try:\n        f.write(json.dumps(meta, ensure_ascii=False, indent=1))\n    finally:\n        f.close()\n\n    # 스스로 검사 - 만든 소리 파일이 실제로 열리는지, 길이가 0 이 아닌지\n    bad = []\n    for it in items:\n        if not it[\"wav\"]:\n            continue\n        try:\n            g = wave.open(it[\"wav\"], \"rb\")\n            try:\n                n = g.getnframes()\n                r = g.getframerate()\n            finally:\n                g.close()\n            if n <= 0 or r <= 0:\n                bad.append(\"장면 %d 의 소리가 비었습니다\" % it[\"scene\"])\n        except Exception as e:\n            bad.append(\"장면 %d 의 소리를 열지 못했습니다: %s\" % (it[\"scene\"], str(e)[:60]))\n\n    print(\"\")\n    if bad:\n        print(\"[검사 미통과]\")\n        for b in bad:\n            print(\"  - \" + b)\n        return 1\n\n    print(\"[DONE] 나레이션 %d 개, 영상 전체 %.2f초\" % (len(have), total_scene))\n    print(\"소리 폴더: \" + workdir)\n    print(\"장면 길이를 맞춘 서식: \" + job_out)\n    print(\"나레이션기록: \" + os.path.join(workdir, \"_narration.json\"))\n    return 0\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    sys.exit(main())\n", "scripts/run.py": "\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n# MN_NEWSCARD_SKILL_V1 / MN_NEWSCARD_SKILL_V2\n# 뉴스 한 건 -> MYNERD 톤 카드 이미지(SVG + PNG)\n# 입력: input.txt 에 JSON 한 덩이. 출력: 만들어진 파일 경로를 stdout 으로.\nimport os, sys, json, math, random, datetime, sqlite3, re  # MN_NEWSCARD_SKILL_V2B\n\nCREAM = \"#EAE7DF\"\nINK = \"#0D0D0D\"\n\nPALETTES = {\n    \"lime\":   {\"accent\": \"#B9E34B\", \"deep\": \"#4C6B1B\", \"screen\": \"#14180C\", \"mid\": \"#2E3D18\", \"on_accent\": INK},\n    \"orange\": {\"accent\": \"#F07A21\", \"deep\": \"#8A3A0C\", \"screen\": \"#1C1109\", \"mid\": \"#3A2010\", \"on_accent\": INK},\n    \"violet\": {\"accent\": \"#7C5CE0\", \"deep\": \"#3B2A78\", \"screen\": \"#14101F\", \"mid\": \"#241B44\", \"on_accent\": \"#FFFFFF\"},\n    \"teal\":   {\"accent\": \"#1FB58C\", \"deep\": \"#0C5443\", \"screen\": \"#0B1714\", \"mid\": \"#123A30\", \"on_accent\": INK},\n    \"coral\":  {\"accent\": \"#E4573D\", \"deep\": \"#7E2214\", \"screen\": \"#1A0D0A\", \"mid\": \"#38150E\", \"on_accent\": \"#FFFFFF\"},\n}\n\nCUT = \"#B9203A\"\n\n\ndef esc(s):\n    s = \"\" if s is None else str(s)\n    return (s.replace(\"&\", \"&amp;\").replace(\"<\", \"&lt;\").replace(\">\", \"&gt;\")\n             .replace('\"', \"&quot;\"))\n\n\ndef clip(s, n):\n    s = \"\" if s is None else str(s)\n    return s if len(s) <= n else s[: n - 1] + \"\\u2026\"\n\n\ndef out_root():\n    for db in (r\"C:\\Mynerd\\config.db\",\n               os.path.join(os.environ.get(\"LOCALAPPDATA\", \"\"), \"mynerd\", \"config.db\")):\n        try:\n            if not os.path.isfile(db):\n                continue\n            con = sqlite3.connect(db)\n            try:\n                r = con.execute(\"SELECT value FROM config WHERE category=? AND key=?\",\n                                (\"SYSTEM\", \"out_root\")).fetchone()\n                if r and str(r[0]).strip():\n                    return str(r[0]).strip()\n            finally:\n                con.close()\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n    return os.path.join(os.path.expanduser(\"~\"), \"Documents\", \"MYNERD\")\n\n\n# MN_NEWSCARD_SKILL_V4\n# cairosvg 는 글꼴 사슬을 안 따라간다 - 첫 이름에서 멈춘다.\n# 그래서 다 그린 뒤, 한글이 든 <text> 만 골라 글꼴을 Pretendard 로 바꾼다.\n_HAN = re.compile(r\"[\\uac00-\\ud7a3\\u3131-\\u318e]\")\n_TEXT = re.compile(r\"<text\\b[^>]*>.*?</text>\", re.S)\n\n\ndef _hanfont(svg):\n    def one(m):\n        el = m.group(0)\n        i = el.find(\">\")\n        body = el[i + 1:]\n        if not _HAN.search(body):\n            return el\n        head = el[:i + 1]\n        head = re.sub(r'font-family=\"[^\"]*\"', 'font-family=\"Pretendard\"', head)\n        return head + body\n\n    return _TEXT.sub(one, svg)\n\n\ndef build(d, shape, pal, rnd):\n    a = pal[\"accent\"]; deep = pal[\"deep\"]; scr = pal[\"screen\"]; mid = pal[\"mid\"]\n    onacc = pal[\"on_accent\"]\n\n    square = (shape == \"square\")\n    W = 800 if square else 680\n    H = 800 if square else 860\n    M = 40 if square else 34\n\n    # 세로형 대비 정사각형은 세로 여백을 줄인다\n    def y(v_tall, v_sq):\n        return v_sq if square else v_tall\n\n    t1 = rnd.uniform(-3.2, -0.8)\n    t2 = rnd.uniform(1.0, 3.0)\n    t3 = rnd.uniform(-4.0, -1.6)\n    ox = rnd.randint(-6, 6)\n\n    hs = 58 if square else 66\n    _hk = bool(re.search(r\"[\\uac00-\\ud7a3]\", d[\"headline1\"] + d[\"headline2\"]))\n    _lim = 9 if _hk else 13\n    _mx = max(len(d[\"headline1\"]), len(d[\"headline2\"]))\n    if _mx > _lim:\n        hs = int(hs * (0.80 if _mx > _lim + 3 else 0.88))\n\n    P = []\n    ap = P.append\n\n    ap('<svg width=\"100%%\" viewBox=\"0 0 %d %d\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">' % (W, H))\n    ap('<title>%s</title>' % esc(d[\"headline1\"] + \" \" + d[\"headline2\"]))\n    ap('<desc>MYNERD news card</desc>')\n    ap('<defs>')\n    ap('<pattern id=\"g\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">'\n       '<circle cx=\"1.1\" cy=\"1.1\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"%s\" opacity=\"0.16\"/></pattern>' % INK)\n    ap('<pattern id=\"h\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\">'\n       '<rect width=\"2.4\" height=\"7\" fill=\"%s\" opacity=\"0.18\"/></pattern>' % INK)\n    ap('<clipPath id=\"c\"><rect width=\"%d\" height=\"%d\"/></clipPath>' % (W, H))\n    ap('</defs>')\n    ap('<g clip-path=\"url(#c)\">')\n    ap('<rect width=\"%d\" height=\"%d\" fill=\"%s\"/>' % (W, H, CREAM))\n    ap('<rect width=\"%d\" height=\"%d\" fill=\"url(#g)\"/>' % (W, H))\n\n    # 머리 띠\n    ap('<rect width=\"%d\" height=\"46\" fill=\"%s\"/>' % (W, INK))\n    ap('<text x=\"%d\" y=\"24\" dominant-baseline=\"central\" font-family=\"Space Mono,ui-monospace,monospace\" '\n       'font-size=\"12\" letter-spacing=\"2.4\" fill=\"%s\">MYNERD / SIGNAL</text>' % (M, CREAM))\n    ap('<text x=\"%d\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"end\" dominant-baseline=\"central\" font-family=\"Space Mono,ui-monospace,monospace\" '\n       'font-size=\"12\" letter-spacing=\"2.4\" fill=\"%s\">%s</text>' % (W - M, a, esc(clip(d[\"issue\"], 22))))\n\n    # 꼬리표\n    ky = y(85, 82)\n    kw = max(96, len(d[\"kicker\"]) * 9 + 26)\n    ap('<rect x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" width=\"%d\" height=\"24\" fill=\"%s\"/>' % (M, ky - 13, kw, a))\n    ap('<text x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\" font-family=\"Space Mono,ui-monospace,monospace\" '\n       'font-size=\"11\" letter-spacing=\"2\" fill=\"%s\">%s</text>' % (M + kw // 2, ky, onacc, esc(clip(d[\"kicker\"], 12))))\n    if d[\"kicker2\"]:\n        ap('<text x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" dominant-baseline=\"central\" font-family=\"Space Mono,ui-monospace,monospace\" '\n           'font-size=\"11\" letter-spacing=\"2\" fill=\"rgba(13,13,13,.5)\">%s</text>'\n           % (M + kw + 14, ky, esc(clip(d[\"kicker2\"], 12))))\n\n    # 제목\n    h1y = y(164, 158); h2y = h1y + hs - 2\n    ap('<text x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" font-family=\"Archivo,sans-serif\" font-size=\"%d\" font-weight=\"700\" '\n       'letter-spacing=\"-2\" fill=\"%s\">%s</text>' % (M - 2, h1y, hs, INK, esc(d[\"headline1\"])))\n    ap('<text x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" font-family=\"Archivo,sans-serif\" font-size=\"%d\" font-weight=\"700\" '\n       'letter-spacing=\"-2\" fill=\"%s\">%s</text>' % (M - 2, h2y, hs, INK, esc(d[\"headline2\"])))\n    ap('<rect x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" width=\"%d\" height=\"12\" fill=\"%s\"/>'\n       % (M - 2, h2y + 16, min(W - 2 * M, len(d[\"headline2\"]) * int(hs * (0.62 if re.search(r\"[\\uac00-\\ud7a3]\", d[\"headline2\"]) else 0.44))), a))\n\n    sfy = h2y + 60\n    ap('<text x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" font-family=\"Archivo,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"500\" '\n       'fill=\"rgba(13,13,13,.72)\">%s</text>' % (M - 2, sfy, esc(clip(d[\"standfirst\"], 58))))\n\n    # 모니터\n    # MN_NEWSCARD_SKILL_V5: 아래 블록 자리를 먼저 확보하고, 남은 높이에 모니터를 맞춘다.\n    # MN_NEWSCARD_SKILL_V6: 아래 블록이 실제 쓰는 높이만 떼고 나머지는 그림에 준다.\n    FOOT = 102          # 발 띠\n    NEED = 206          # 구분선~도장 아래 실측\n    my = sfy + 30\n    avail = (H - FOOT - 20 - NEED) - my - 46   # 46 = 받침대(34+12)\n    ratio = 0.68 if square else 0.56           # 정사각형은 가로로 넓게\n    mw = int(W * ratio)\n    mh = int(mw * 0.558)\n    if avail < mh:\n        if avail < 150:\n            avail = 150\n        mh = int(avail)\n        mw = int(mh / 0.558)\n    cap = W - 2 * M - (70 if square else 90)\n    if mw > cap:\n        mw = cap\n        mh = int(mw * 0.558)\n    mx = (W - mw) // 2 + ox\n    if square:\n        mx -= 14                               # 왼쪽 해칭 조각과 균형\n    sx = mx + 32; sy = my + 12; sw = mw - 64; sh = mh - 24\n    ap('<rect x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" width=\"%d\" height=\"%d\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"%s\"/>' % (mx, my, mw, mh, INK))\n    ap('<rect x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" width=\"%d\" height=\"%d\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"%s\"/>' % (sx, sy, sw, sh, scr))\n    ap('<clipPath id=\"sc\"><rect x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" width=\"%d\" height=\"%d\" rx=\"3\"/></clipPath>' % (sx, sy, sw, sh))\n    ap('<g clip-path=\"url(#sc)\">')\n    ap('<rect x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" width=\"%d\" height=\"26\" fill=\"%s\"/>' % (sx, sy, sw, INK))\n    ap('<circle cx=\"%d\" cy=\"%d\" r=\"4\" fill=\"%s\"/>' % (sx + 14, sy + 13, a))\n    ap('<text x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" dominant-baseline=\"central\" font-family=\"Space Mono,ui-monospace,monospace\" '\n       'font-size=\"9\" letter-spacing=\"1.4\" fill=\"%s\">%s</text>'\n       % (sx + 28, sy + 14, a, esc(clip(d[\"screen_label\"], 20))))\n\n    cols = 4\n    rows = 3 if sh >= 170 else (2 if sh >= 120 else 1)\n    cw = int((sw - 24 - (cols - 1) * 10) / cols)\n    ch = max(24, int((sh - 38 - 22 - (rows - 1) * 10) / rows))\n    fills = [a, deep, mid]\n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            cx = sx + 12 + c * (cw + 10)\n            cy = sy + 38 + r * (ch + 10)\n            ap('<rect x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" width=\"%d\" height=\"%d\" fill=\"%s\"/>'\n               % (cx, cy, cw, ch, fills[rnd.randrange(3)]))\n\n    by = sy + 38 + rows * (ch + 10) + 6\n    bw = sw - 24 - 44\n    ap('<rect x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" width=\"%d\" height=\"6\" fill=\"%s\"/>' % (sx + 12, by, bw, mid))\n    ap('<rect x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" width=\"%d\" height=\"6\" fill=\"%s\"/>' % (sx + 12, by, int(bw * 0.78), a))\n    ap('</g>')\n\n    ap('<rect x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" width=\"48\" height=\"34\" fill=\"%s\"/>' % (mx + mw // 2 - 24, my + mh, INK))\n    ap('<rect x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" width=\"%d\" height=\"12\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"%s\"/>'\n       % (mx + mw // 2 - 84, my + mh + 34, 168, INK))\n\n    # 끊긴 클라우드\n    ccx = mx + mw + 60\n    if ccx + 44 < W - 10:\n        ccy = my + 48\n        ap('<g opacity=\"0.45\"><ellipse cx=\"%d\" cy=\"%d\" rx=\"40\" ry=\"22\" fill=\"%s\"/>'\n           '<ellipse cx=\"%d\" cy=\"%d\" rx=\"26\" ry=\"15\" fill=\"%s\"/>'\n           '<ellipse cx=\"%d\" cy=\"%d\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"13\" fill=\"%s\"/></g>'\n           % (ccx, ccy, INK, ccx - 26, ccy + 10, INK, ccx + 24, ccy + 12, INK))\n        ap('<path d=\"M%d %d L%d %d\" stroke=\"%s\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" '\n           'stroke-dasharray=\"8 8\"/>' % (ccx - 36, ccy + 30, ccx - 56, ccy + 58, INK))\n        ap('<line x1=\"%d\" y1=\"%d\" x2=\"%d\" y2=\"%d\" stroke=\"%s\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>'\n           % (ccx - 72, ccy + 58, ccx - 48, ccy + 82, CUT))\n        ap('<line x1=\"%d\" y1=\"%d\" x2=\"%d\" y2=\"%d\" stroke=\"%s\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>'\n           % (ccx - 48, ccy + 58, ccx - 72, ccy + 82, CUT))\n\n    # 해칭 조각\n    ap('<rect x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" width=\"72\" height=\"72\" fill=\"url(#h)\"/>' % (M + 14, my + 42))\n\n    # 아래 (V5: 발 띠에서 거꾸로 계산해 절대 겹치지 않게)\n    fh = FOOT\n    _min = my + mh + 56\n    _max = H - fh - 20 - NEED\n    ly = _min + int((_max - _min) * 0.45) if _max > _min else _min\n    ap('<line x1=\"%d\" y1=\"%d\" x2=\"%d\" y2=\"%d\" stroke=\"%s\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>' % (M - 2, ly, W - M, ly, INK))\n\n    bigy = ly + 44\n    bs = 92 if len(d[\"big\"]) <= 3 else 64\n    ap('<text x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" font-family=\"Archivo,sans-serif\" font-size=\"%d\" font-weight=\"700\" '\n       'letter-spacing=\"-3\" fill=\"%s\">%s</text>' % (M - 2, bigy, bs, INK, esc(clip(d[\"big\"], 6))))\n    _wide = 0.62 if re.search(r\"[\\uac00-\\ud7a3]\", d[\"big\"]) else 0.58\n    tx = M + len(d[\"big\"]) * int(bs * _wide) + 16\n    ap('<text x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" font-family=\"Archivo,sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"%s\">%s</text>'\n       % (tx, bigy - 20, INK, esc(clip(d[\"big_line1\"], 32))))\n    ap('<text x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" font-family=\"Archivo,sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"%s\">%s</text>'\n       % (tx, bigy + 4, INK, esc(clip(d[\"big_line2\"], 32))))\n    ap('<rect x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" width=\"150\" height=\"8\" fill=\"%s\"/>' % (tx, bigy + 14, a))\n\n    sty = bigy + 46\n    if sty + 44 > H - fh - 14:\n        sty = H - fh - 14 - 44\n    stw = max(150, len(d[\"stamp\"]) * 11 + 34)\n    ap('<g transform=\"rotate(%.2f %d %d)\">' % (t3, M + stw // 2, sty + 22))\n    ap('<rect x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" width=\"%d\" height=\"44\" fill=\"%s\" stroke=\"%s\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>'\n       % (M, sty, stw, a, INK))\n    ap('<text x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\" font-family=\"Archivo,sans-serif\" '\n       'font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"%s\">%s</text>'\n       % (M + stw // 2, sty + 22, onacc, esc(clip(d[\"stamp\"], 18))))\n    ap('</g>')\n\n    nx = M + stw + 30\n    ap('<text x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" font-family=\"Archivo,sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-style=\"italic\" '\n       'fill=\"rgba(13,13,13,.66)\">%s</text>' % (nx, sty + 20, esc(clip(d[\"kicker_note1\"], 26))))\n    ap('<text x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" font-family=\"Archivo,sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-style=\"italic\" '\n       'fill=\"rgba(13,13,13,.66)\">%s</text>' % (nx, sty + 44, esc(clip(d[\"kicker_note2\"], 26))))\n\n    # 발\n    ap('<rect x=\"0\" y=\"%d\" width=\"%d\" height=\"%d\" fill=\"%s\"/>' % (H - fh, W, fh, INK))\n    ap('<rect x=\"0\" y=\"%d\" width=\"%d\" height=\"5\" fill=\"%s\"/>' % (H - fh, W, a))\n    ap('<text x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" dominant-baseline=\"central\" font-family=\"Archivo,sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" '\n       'font-weight=\"700\" letter-spacing=\"4\" fill=\"%s\">MYNERD</text>' % (M, H - fh + 42, CREAM))\n    ap('<text x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" dominant-baseline=\"central\" font-family=\"Space Mono,ui-monospace,monospace\" '\n       'font-size=\"10\" letter-spacing=\"2\" fill=\"rgba(234,231,223,.55)\">AI THAT RUNS WHERE YOU ARE</text>'\n       % (M, H - fh + 68))\n    ap('<text x=\"%d\" y=\"%d\" text-anchor=\"end\" dominant-baseline=\"central\" font-family=\"Space Mono,ui-monospace,monospace\" '\n       'font-size=\"11\" letter-spacing=\"2\" fill=\"%s\">%s</text>'\n       % (W - M, H - fh + 54, a, esc(clip(d[\"source\"], 24))))\n\n    ap('</g></svg>')\n    svg = \"\\n\".join(P)\n    return _hanfont(svg), W, H\n\n\ndef main():\n    try:\n        raw = open(\"input.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"ignore\").read().strip()\n    except Exception:\n        raw = \"\"\n    if not raw:\n        raw = \" \".join(sys.argv[1:]).strip()\n\n    try:\n        i = raw.find(\"{\"); j = raw.rfind(\"}\")\n        d = json.loads(raw[i:j + 1]) if i >= 0 else {}\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(\"[ERR] 입력이 JSON 이 아닙니다: %r\" % (e,))\n        return\n\n    dflt = {\n        \"kicker\": \"AI\", \"kicker2\": \"\", \"headline1\": \"\", \"headline2\": \"\",\n        \"standfirst\": \"\", \"screen_label\": \"LOCAL RUNTIME\", \"big\": \"\",\n        \"big_line1\": \"\", \"big_line2\": \"\", \"stamp\": \"\",\n        \"kicker_note1\": \"\", \"kicker_note2\": \"\", \"source\": \"\",\n        \"issue\": datetime.datetime.now().strftime(\"NO. %j - %b %Y\").upper(),\n        \"palette\": \"lime\", \"shape\": \"tall\", \"lang\": \"en\", \"seed\": 0, \"out\": \"\",\n    }\n    for k, v in dflt.items():\n        if k not in d or d[k] is None:\n            d[k] = v\n        if isinstance(v, str):\n            d[k] = str(d[k])\n\n    if not d[\"headline1\"] and not d[\"headline2\"]:\n        print(\"[ERR] headline1 또는 headline2 가 필요합니다.\")\n        return\n\n    pal = PALETTES.get(str(d[\"palette\"]).lower(), PALETTES[\"lime\"])\n    try:\n        seed = int(d[\"seed\"])\n    except Exception:\n        seed = 0\n    if not seed:\n        seed = int(datetime.datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y%m%d%H%M\"))\n    rnd = random.Random(seed)\n\n    shape = \"square\" if str(d[\"shape\"]).lower().startswith(\"s\") else \"tall\"\n    svg, W, H = build(d, shape, pal, rnd)\n\n    outdir = d[\"out\"].strip() or os.path.join(out_root(), \"images\", \"cardnews\")\n    try:\n        os.makedirs(outdir, exist_ok=True)\n    except Exception:\n        outdir = out_root()\n\n    stamp = datetime.datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y%m%d_%H%M%S\")\n    base = \"card_%s_%s_%s\" % (stamp, d[\"lang\"], shape)\n    sp = os.path.join(outdir, base + \".svg\")\n    with open(sp, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(svg)\n\n    png = \"\"\n    try:\n        import cairosvg\n        pp = os.path.join(outdir, base + \".png\")\n        cairosvg.svg2png(bytestring=svg.encode(\"utf-8\"), write_to=pp,\n                         output_width=W * 2, output_height=H * 2)\n        png = pp\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(\"[알림] PNG 로 굽지 못했습니다(cairosvg 없음 또는 오류): %s\" % (e,))\n\n    print(\"[DONE] 카드 만듦\")\n    print(\"모양: %s (%dx%d) / 강조색: %s / 언어: %s\" % (shape, W, H, d[\"palette\"], d[\"lang\"]))\n    print(\"SVG: \" + sp)\n    if png:\n        print(\"PNG: \" + png)\n    else:\n        print(\"PNG 없음 - SVG 를 쓰거나 cairosvg 를 설치하세요.\")\n\n\ntry:\n    main()\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(\"[ERR] %r\" % (e,))\nsys.exit(0)\n", "scripts/story.py": "# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n# MN_NEWSCARD_STORY_V1\n# 뉴스 한 건 -> 여러 장면을 이어 붙인 카드뉴스 영상(MP4) + 커버 그림\n# 색, 글꼴, 사진, 검사는 motion.py 의 것을 그대로 쓴다.\nimport os, sys, json, math, random, datetime, subprocess, shutil\n\nHERE = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))\nif HERE not in sys.path:\n    sys.path.insert(0, HERE)\n\n# MN_NEWSCARD_PATHBOOT_V1 - 워크플로우가 임시 폴더에서 돌릴 때 원래 스킬 폴더를 길에 넣는다\nfor _cand in (os.environ.get(\"MYNERD_SKILL_SCRIPTS\", \"\"),\n              r\"C:\\Mynerd\\skills\\뉴스 카드 만들기\\scripts\"):\n    if _cand and os.path.isdir(_cand) and _cand not in sys.path:\n        sys.path.append(_cand)\n\nimport motion as M\nimport characters as C  # MN_NEWSCARD_STORY_CHARS_V1\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw\n\nCREAM = M.CREAM\nINK = M.INK\n\n\ndef lay(shape, W, H):\n    if shape == \"square\":\n        return {\"M\": 84, \"label_y\": 96, \"s_label\": 24, \"s_head\": 84, \"lh_head\": 96,\n                \"s_body\": 46, \"s_sub\": 32, \"s_big\": 200, \"s_quote\": 50,\n                \"body_y\": 300, \"foot\": 84, \"s_foot\": 21, \"s_cta\": 30}\n    if shape == \"story\":\n        return {\"M\": 92, \"label_y\": 190, \"s_label\": 30, \"s_head\": 116, \"lh_head\": 132,\n                \"s_body\": 60, \"s_sub\": 42, \"s_big\": 280, \"s_quote\": 66,\n                \"body_y\": 560, \"foot\": 130, \"s_foot\": 26, \"s_cta\": 40}\n    return {\"M\": 88, \"label_y\": 120, \"s_label\": 26, \"s_head\": 100, \"lh_head\": 114,\n            \"s_body\": 54, \"s_sub\": 38, \"s_big\": 240, \"s_quote\": 58,\n            \"body_y\": 380, \"foot\": 100, \"s_foot\": 23, \"s_cta\": 34}\n\n\ndef bg_frame(p, ctx, idx):\n    \"\"\"장면마다 사진의 다른 자리를 보여 준다.\"\"\"\n    bases = ctx.get(\"bases\") or [ctx[\"base\"]]\n    base = bases[idx % len(bases)]\n    W, H = ctx[\"W\"], ctx[\"H\"]\n    bw, bh = base.size\n    k = 1.0 - 0.09 * M.ease(p)\n    cw, ch = int(bw * k), int(bh * k)\n    fx = 0.5 + 0.16 * math.sin(idx * 1.7)\n    fy = 0.5 + 0.14 * math.cos(idx * 2.3)\n    px = int(max(0, min(bw - cw, (bw - cw) * fx)))\n    py = int(max(0, min(bh - ch, (bh - ch) * fy)))\n    im = base.crop((px, py, px + cw, py + ch)).resize((W, H), Image.BILINEAR)\n    ov = Image.new(\"RGBA\", (W, H), INK + (int(255 * ctx[\"dim\"]),))\n    im = Image.alpha_composite(im.convert(\"RGBA\"), ov)\n    return Image.alpha_composite(im, ctx[\"grid\"])\n\n\nCALM = (\"fade\", \"up\", \"bars\")\nLIVELY = (\"side\", \"up\", \"blocks\", \"bars\", \"fade\")\n\n\ndef pick_wipe(idx, ctx, sc):\n    \"\"\"장면마다 다른 전환을 고른다. 무거운 소식에는 얌전한 것만 쓴다.\"\"\"\n    kind = sc.get(\"wipe\")\n    if kind:\n        return kind\n    pool = ctx.get(\"transitions\") or (CALM if ctx.get(\"mood\") == \"calm\" else LIVELY)\n    return pool[idx % len(pool)]\n\n\ndef wipe(im, p, ctx, idx=0, sc=None):\n    \"\"\"장면이 바뀔 때 화면을 덮었다 걷는다. MN_NEWSCARD_STORY_V3\"\"\"\n    if p >= 0.16:\n        return im\n    q = p / 0.16\n    W, H = ctx[\"W\"], ctx[\"H\"]\n    ac = ctx[\"pal\"][\"accent\"]\n    kind = pick_wipe(idx, ctx, sc or {})\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(im, \"RGBA\")\n\n    if kind == \"fade\":\n        a = int(255 * (1 - q) ** 1.5)\n        if a > 2:\n            d.rectangle([0, 0, W, H], fill=ac + (a,))\n        return im\n\n    if kind == \"up\":\n        if q < 0.5:\n            y = int(H * M.ease(q * 2))\n            d.rectangle([0, H - y, W, H], fill=ac + (255,))\n        else:\n            y = int(H * M.ease((q - 0.5) * 2))\n            d.rectangle([0, 0, W, H - y], fill=ac + (255,))\n        return im\n\n    if kind == \"bars\":\n        n = 7\n        bh = H // n + 1\n        for i in range(n):\n            t0 = i * 0.05\n            g = max(0.0, min(1.0, (q - t0) / 0.5))\n            if q < 0.55:\n                w = int(W * M.ease(g))\n                x0 = 0 if i % 2 == 0 else W - w\n                d.rectangle([x0, i * bh, x0 + w, (i + 1) * bh], fill=ac + (255,))\n            else:\n                g2 = max(0.0, min(1.0, (q - 0.5 - t0) / 0.5))\n                w = int(W * (1 - M.ease(g2)))\n                x0 = 0 if i % 2 == 0 else W - w\n                d.rectangle([x0, i * bh, x0 + w, (i + 1) * bh], fill=ac + (255,))\n        return im\n\n    if kind == \"blocks\":\n        cols, rows = 4, 6\n        bw2, bh2 = W // cols + 1, H // rows + 1\n        rnd = random.Random(idx * 977 + 13)\n        order = [(cx, cy) for cy in range(rows) for cx in range(cols)]\n        rnd.shuffle(order)\n        total = len(order)\n        for i, (cx, cy) in enumerate(order):\n            t0 = (i / float(total)) * 0.45\n            if q < 0.55:\n                g = max(0.0, min(1.0, (q - t0) / 0.35))\n            else:\n                g = 1.0 - max(0.0, min(1.0, (q - 0.5 - t0) / 0.35))\n            if g <= 0.02:\n                continue\n            s = int(min(bw2, bh2) * M.ease(g) * 1.5)\n            x0 = cx * bw2 + bw2 // 2 - s // 2\n            y0 = cy * bh2 + bh2 // 2 - s // 2\n            d.rectangle([x0, y0, x0 + s, y0 + s], fill=ac + (255,))\n        return im\n\n    if q < 0.5:\n        x = int(W * M.ease(q * 2))\n        d.rectangle([0, 0, x, H], fill=ac + (255,))\n    else:\n        x = int(W * M.ease((q - 0.5) * 2))\n        d.rectangle([x, 0, W, H], fill=ac + (255,))\n    return im\n\n\ndef progress(d, ctx, idx, total):\n    W, H = ctx[\"W\"], ctx[\"H\"]\n    c = ctx[\"c\"]\n    y = H - c[\"foot\"] + 6\n    r = 5\n    gap = 22\n    x = c[\"M\"]\n    for i in range(total):\n        if i == idx:\n            d.rectangle([x, y - r, x + 26, y + r], fill=ctx[\"pal\"][\"accent\"] + (255,))\n            x += 26 + gap\n        else:\n            d.ellipse([x, y - r, x + r * 2, y + r * 2 - r], fill=CREAM + (90,))\n            x += r * 2 + gap\n\n\ndef foot(d, ctx, sc):\n    W, H = ctx[\"W\"], ctx[\"H\"]\n    c = ctx[\"c\"]\n    f = M.font(\"mono\", c[\"s_foot\"], \"\")\n    y = H - c[\"foot\"] // 2 + 18\n    # MN_NEWSCARD_STORY_V3 - 사진 출처는 화면에 넣지 않는다(표시 의무 없음). 기록은 파일에 남는다\n    left = (ctx[\"source\"] or \"\").upper()\n    if left:\n        d.text((c[\"M\"], y), left[:60], font=f, fill=CREAM + (140,), anchor=\"lm\")\n    fm = M.font(\"label\", c[\"s_foot\"] + 3, \"\")\n    d.text((W - c[\"M\"], y), \"MYNERD\", font=fm, fill=ctx[\"pal\"][\"accent\"] + (220,), anchor=\"rm\")\n\n\ndef label(d, ctx, txt, p):\n    if not txt:\n        return\n    c = ctx[\"c\"]\n    g = M.ease(M.seg(p, 0.05, 0.28))\n    if g <= 0:\n        return\n    ac = ctx[\"pal\"][\"accent\"]\n    f = M.font(\"label\", c[\"s_label\"], txt)\n    x = c[\"M\"] - int((1 - g) * 160)\n    y = c[\"label_y\"]\n    d.rectangle([x, y, x + 26, y + c[\"s_label\"]], fill=ac + (int(255 * g),))\n    d.text((x + 40, y + c[\"s_label\"] // 2), txt.upper(), font=f,\n           fill=CREAM + (int(230 * g),), anchor=\"lm\")\n\n\ndef lines_block(d, ctx, texts, p, top, size, kind=\"body\", start=0.16, color=None):\n    \"\"\"줄이 하나씩 아래에서 올라온다.\"\"\"\n    c = ctx[\"c\"]\n    W = ctx[\"W\"]\n    y = top\n    col = color or CREAM\n    i = 0\n    for t in texts:\n        f = M.font(kind, size, t)\n        for ln in M.wrap(d, t, f, W - c[\"M\"] * 2):\n            g = M.ease(M.seg(p, start + i * 0.07, start + i * 0.07 + 0.30))\n            if g > 0:\n                d.text((c[\"M\"], y + int((1 - g) * 34)), ln, font=f,\n                       fill=col + (int(245 * g),))\n            y += int(size * 1.36)\n            i += 1\n    return y\n\n\ndef char_life(base_state, p, idx, size):\n    \"\"\"장면이 흐르는 동안 캐릭터가 살아 있게 한다.\n    글이 뜨는 왼쪽 위를 보다가 정면으로 돌아오고, 두 번 깜빡이고,\n    놀람이나 웃음은 도중에 번진다. MN_NEWSCARD_CHAR_LIFE_V1\"\"\"\n    rnd = random.Random(idx * 331 + 7)\n\n    # 시선 - 앞부분엔 글 쪽(왼쪽 위)을 보고, 중간에 정면, 끝에 살짝 아래\n    if p < 0.34:\n        g = M.ease(p / 0.34)\n        lx = -0.030 * (1 - g * 0.25)\n        ly = -0.022 * (1 - g * 0.25)\n    elif p < 0.62:\n        g = M.ease((p - 0.34) / 0.28)\n        lx = -0.022 * (1 - g)\n        ly = -0.017 * (1 - g)\n    else:\n        g = M.ease((p - 0.62) / 0.38)\n        lx = 0.010 * g\n        ly = 0.014 * g\n    lx += 0.004 * math.sin(p * 21.0 + idx)\n    ly += 0.003 * math.cos(p * 17.0 + idx)\n\n    # 깜빡임 - 장면마다 두 번, 자리는 조금씩 다르게\n    ok = 1.0\n    for t0 in (0.30 + rnd.random() * 0.10, 0.72 + rnd.random() * 0.10):\n        dt = abs(p - t0)\n        if dt < 0.035:\n            ok = min(ok, max(0.06, dt / 0.035))\n\n    # 표정 - 도중에 번진다\n    st = base_state\n    if base_state == \"surprise\":\n        st = \"normal\" if p < 0.24 else \"surprise\"\n    elif base_state == \"happy\":\n        st = \"normal\" if p < 0.40 else \"happy\"\n    elif base_state == \"alert\":\n        st = \"normal\" if p < 0.30 else \"alert\"\n    elif base_state == \"work\":\n        st = \"normal\" if (p % 0.5) < 0.08 else \"work\"\n\n    # 몸짓 - 놀라면 튀고, 일하는 중이면 잔잔히\n    amp = 0.075 if base_state == \"surprise\" else 0.045\n    bob = int(math.sin(p * (7.6 if base_state == \"surprise\" else 5.2)) * size * amp)\n    if base_state == \"surprise\" and 0.22 < p < 0.34:\n        bob -= int(size * 0.10 * math.sin((p - 0.22) / 0.12 * math.pi))\n\n    return st, ok, (lx, ly), bob\n\n\n# MN_NEWSCARD_STYLE_NODE_V1 - 값 노드에서 온 것을 원고 값으로 옮긴다\nSHAPE_WORDS = {\"세로형\": \"tall\", \"세로\": \"tall\", \"tall\": \"tall\",\n               \"정사각형\": \"square\", \"정사각\": \"square\", \"square\": \"square\",\n               \"세로 꽉 참\": \"story\", \"꽉참\": \"story\", \"story\": \"story\"}\n\nWIPE_WORDS = {\"쓸기\": \"side\", \"좌우\": \"side\", \"side\": \"side\",\n              \"밀기\": \"up\", \"위로\": \"up\", \"up\": \"up\",\n              \"옅어짐\": \"fade\", \"페이드\": \"fade\", \"fade\": \"fade\",\n              \"막대\": \"bars\", \"bars\": \"bars\",\n              \"조각\": \"blocks\", \"blocks\": \"blocks\"}\n\n\ndef _hexrgb(s):\n    s = (s or \"\").strip().lstrip(\"#\")\n    if len(s) != 6:\n        return None\n    try:\n        return (int(s[0:2], 16), int(s[2:4], 16), int(s[4:6], 16))\n    except Exception:\n        return None\n\n\ndef _pick_lines(v):\n    # MN_NEWSCARD_STYLE_SEP_V1 - 줄바꿈, 쉼표, 슬래시 무엇으로 나눠도 알아듣는다\n    if isinstance(v, (list, tuple)):\n        out = [str(x).strip() for x in v]\n    else:\n        s = str(v or \"\")\n        for sep in (\",\", \"/\", \"|\"):\n            s = s.replace(sep, \"\\n\")\n        out = [x.strip() for x in s.split(\"\\n\")]\n    return [x for x in out if x]\n\n\ndef apply_style(d0):\n    \"\"\"입력에 값 노드가 실려 오면 그 값으로 덮어쓴다. 없으면 그대로 둔다.\"\"\"\n    global CREAM, INK\n    st = d0.get(\"스타일\") or d0.get(\"style\") or {}\n    if not isinstance(st, dict):\n        st = {}\n    # MN_NEWSCARD_STYLE_TOP_V1 - 서식형 워크플로우가 최상위에 싣는 값도 알아듣는다\n    if not st.get(\"transitions\") and (d0.get(\"transitions\") or d0.get(\"transition\")):\n        st = dict(st)\n        st[\"transitions\"] = d0.get(\"transitions\") or d0.get(\"transition\")\n    if not st.get(\"colors\") and d0.get(\"colors\"):\n        st = dict(st)\n        st[\"colors\"] = d0.get(\"colors\")\n    if not st:\n        return d0, None\n\n    cols = _pick_lines(st.get(\"colors\"))\n    pal = None\n    if cols:\n        bg = _hexrgb(cols[0]) if len(cols) > 0 else None\n        fg = _hexrgb(cols[1]) if len(cols) > 1 else None\n        ac = _hexrgb(cols[2]) if len(cols) > 2 else None\n        if bg:\n            INK = bg\n        if fg:\n            CREAM = fg\n        if ac:\n            deep = tuple(int(c * 0.42) for c in ac)\n            lum = (ac[0] * 299 + ac[1] * 587 + ac[2] * 114) / 1000.0\n            on = (13, 13, 13) if lum > 140 else (255, 255, 255)\n            pal = {\"accent\": ac, \"deep\": deep, \"on_accent\": on}\n\n    sh = str(st.get(\"shape\") or \"\").strip()\n    if sh:\n        for k, v in SHAPE_WORDS.items():\n            if k in sh:\n                d0[\"shape\"] = v\n                break\n\n    for src_key, dst_key in ((\"scene_seconds\", \"scene_seconds\"), (\"fps\", \"fps\"),\n                             (\"seed\", \"seed\")):\n        v = str(st.get(src_key) or \"\").strip()\n        if v:\n            try:\n                d0[dst_key] = float(v) if \".\" in v else int(v)\n            except Exception:\n                pass\n\n    tr = _pick_lines(st.get(\"transitions\"))\n    picked = []\n    for t in tr:\n        for k, v in WIPE_WORDS.items():\n            if k in t and v not in picked:\n                picked.append(v)\n    if picked:\n        d0[\"transitions\"] = picked\n\n    n = str(st.get(\"scenes\") or \"\").strip()\n    if n:\n        try:\n            want = max(1, min(12, int(n)))\n            sc = d0.get(\"scenes\") or []\n            if sc and len(sc) > want:\n                keep = [s for s in sc if (s.get(\"type\") in (\"cover\", \"logo\", \"outro\"))]\n                mid = [s for s in sc if s not in keep]\n                d0[\"scenes\"] = ([sc[0]] + mid[:max(0, want - len(keep))]\n                                + [s for s in keep if s is not sc[0]])[:want]\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n\n    return d0, pal\n\n\ndef draw_scene(sc, p, ctx, idx, total):\n    # MN_NEWSCARD_STORY_DIM_V1\n    if (sc.get(\"type\") or \"\") == \"logo\":\n        keep = ctx[\"dim\"]\n        ctx[\"dim\"] = min(0.9, keep + 0.2)\n        im = bg_frame(p, ctx, idx)\n        ctx[\"dim\"] = keep\n    else:\n        im = bg_frame(p, ctx, idx)\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(im, \"RGBA\")\n    c = ctx[\"c\"]\n    W, H = ctx[\"W\"], ctx[\"H\"]\n    ac = ctx[\"pal\"][\"accent\"]\n    kind = (sc.get(\"type\") or \"text\").lower()\n\n    g = M.ease(M.seg(p, 0.0, 0.30))\n    d.rectangle([0, 0, 11, int(H * g)], fill=ac + (255,))\n\n    if kind == \"cover\":\n        gk = M.ease(M.seg(p, 0.06, 0.30))\n        if gk > 0:\n            kick = (sc.get(\"kicker\") or \"\").upper()\n            if kick:\n                f = M.font(\"label\", c[\"s_label\"] + 4, kick)\n                tw = d.textlength(kick, font=f)\n                bx = c[\"M\"] - int((1 - gk) * 200)\n                by = c[\"label_y\"]\n                bh = c[\"s_label\"] + 30\n                d.rectangle([bx, by, bx + int(tw) + 44, by + bh],\n                            fill=ac + (int(255 * gk),))\n                d.text((bx + 22, by + bh // 2), kick, font=f,\n                       fill=ctx[\"pal\"][\"on_accent\"] + (int(255 * gk),), anchor=\"lm\")\n                k2 = (sc.get(\"kicker2\") or \"\").upper()\n                if k2:\n                    f2 = M.font(\"label\", c[\"s_label\"] + 4, k2)\n                    d.text((bx + int(tw) + 66, by + bh // 2), k2, font=f2,\n                           fill=CREAM + (int(200 * gk),), anchor=\"lm\")\n        y = c[\"body_y\"] - 60\n        for i, t in enumerate([sc.get(\"headline1\") or \"\", sc.get(\"headline2\") or \"\"]):\n            if not t:\n                continue\n            gg = M.ease(M.seg(p, 0.16 + i * 0.10, 0.16 + i * 0.10 + 0.28))\n            f = M.font(\"title\", c[\"s_head\"], t)\n            if gg > 0:\n                d.text((c[\"M\"], y + int((1 - gg) * 44)), t, font=f,\n                       fill=CREAM + (int(255 * gg),))\n            y += c[\"lh_head\"]\n        gl = M.ease(M.seg(p, 0.42, 0.58))\n        if gl > 0:\n            d.rectangle([c[\"M\"], y + 22, c[\"M\"] + int((W - c[\"M\"] * 2) * gl), y + 27],\n                        fill=ac + (255,))\n        sf = sc.get(\"standfirst\") or \"\"\n        if sf:\n            lines_block(d, ctx, [sf], p, y + 66, c[\"s_sub\"], \"body\", 0.50)\n\n    elif kind == \"number\":\n        label(d, ctx, sc.get(\"label\") or \"\", p)\n        big = str(sc.get(\"big\") or \"\")\n        gb = M.ease(M.seg(p, 0.14, 0.52))\n        digits = \"\".join(ch for ch in big if ch.isdigit())\n        if digits and len(digits) <= 7:\n            cur = int(int(digits) * gb)\n            show = big.replace(digits, str(cur), 1)\n        else:\n            show = big\n        f = M.font(\"num\", c[\"s_big\"], show)\n        y = c[\"body_y\"] - 40\n        if gb > 0:\n            d.text((c[\"M\"], y), show, font=f, fill=ac + (255,))\n        y += int(c[\"s_big\"] * 1.12)\n        notes = [t for t in (sc.get(\"lines\") or []) if t]\n        if notes:\n            lines_block(d, ctx, notes, p, y, c[\"s_body\"], \"body\", 0.48)\n\n    elif kind == \"quote\":\n        label(d, ctx, sc.get(\"label\") or \"\", p)\n        txt = sc.get(\"text\") or \"\"\n        f = M.font(\"title\", c[\"s_quote\"], txt)\n        rows = M.wrap(d, txt, f, W - c[\"M\"] * 2 - 40)\n        top = c[\"body_y\"]\n        gh = M.ease(M.seg(p, 0.12, 0.40))\n        hgt = int(len(rows) * c[\"s_quote\"] * 1.34)\n        d.rectangle([c[\"M\"], top, c[\"M\"] + 9, top + int(hgt * gh)], fill=ac + (255,))\n        y = top\n        for i, ln in enumerate(rows):\n            gg = M.ease(M.seg(p, 0.18 + i * 0.08, 0.18 + i * 0.08 + 0.30))\n            if gg > 0:\n                d.text((c[\"M\"] + 38, y + int((1 - gg) * 30)), ln, font=f,\n                       fill=CREAM + (int(250 * gg),))\n            y += int(c[\"s_quote\"] * 1.34)\n\n    elif kind == \"logo\":\n        # MN_NEWSCARD_STORY_OUTRO_V2\n        gs = M.ease(M.seg(p, 0.02, 0.24))\n        head = sc.get(\"headline1\") or \"\"\n        y = c[\"label_y\"] + 20\n        if head and gs > 0:\n            f = M.font(\"title\", int(c[\"s_head\"] * 0.70), head)\n            for ln in M.wrap(d, head, f, W - c[\"M\"] * 2):\n                d.text((c[\"M\"], y + int((1 - gs) * 30)), ln, font=f,\n                       fill=CREAM + (int(255 * gs),))\n                y += int(c[\"s_head\"] * 0.82)\n        body = [t for t in (sc.get(\"lines\") or []) if t]\n        if body:\n            y = lines_block(d, ctx, body, p, y + 20, int(c[\"s_body\"] * 0.88),\n                            \"body\", 0.12)\n        box = int(min(W - c[\"M\"] * 2, H * 0.26))   # MN_NEWSCARD_SIZE_V1 : 로고를 줄였다\n        bx = (W - box) // 2\n        by = max(y + 40, int(H * 0.46))\n        by = min(by, H - c[\"foot\"] - box - 150)\n        C.build_logo(im, p, (bx, by, box), ac)\n        d = ImageDraw.Draw(im, \"RGBA\")\n        gt = M.ease(M.seg(p, 0.60, 0.74))\n        if gt > 0:\n            f = M.font(\"title\", int(c[\"s_head\"] * 0.54), \"MYNERD\")\n            d.text((W // 2, by + box + 44), \"MYNERD\", font=f,\n                   fill=CREAM + (int(255 * gt),), anchor=\"ma\")\n            tag = sc.get(\"cta\") or \"\"\n            if tag:\n                f2 = M.font(\"mono\", c[\"s_cta\"] - 6, tag)\n                d.text((W // 2, by + box + 44 + int(c[\"s_head\"] * 0.66)), tag,\n                       font=f2, fill=ac + (int(230 * gt),), anchor=\"ma\")\n\n    elif kind == \"outro\":\n        label(d, ctx, sc.get(\"label\") or \"MYNERD VIEW\", p)\n        head = sc.get(\"headline1\") or \"\"\n        y = c[\"body_y\"] - 80\n        if head:\n            f = M.font(\"title\", int(c[\"s_head\"] * 0.82), head)\n            gg = M.ease(M.seg(p, 0.12, 0.40))\n            for ln in M.wrap(d, head, f, W - c[\"M\"] * 2):\n                if gg > 0:\n                    d.text((c[\"M\"], y + int((1 - gg) * 40)), ln, font=f,\n                           fill=CREAM + (int(255 * gg),))\n                y += int(c[\"s_head\"] * 0.94)\n        body = [t for t in (sc.get(\"lines\") or []) if t]\n        if body:\n            y = lines_block(d, ctx, body, p, y + 30, c[\"s_body\"], \"body\", 0.34)\n        cta = sc.get(\"cta\") or \"\"\n        if cta:\n            gc = M.seg(p, 0.58, 0.74)\n            if gc > 0:\n                sc2 = 1.0 + 0.22 * (1 - M.ease(gc))\n                f = M.font(\"label\", c[\"s_cta\"], cta)\n                tw = int(d.textlength(cta, font=f))\n                pad = 26\n                bw2, bh2 = tw + pad * 2 + 46, c[\"s_cta\"] + pad\n                box = Image.new(\"RGBA\", (bw2 + 6, bh2 + 6), (0, 0, 0, 0))\n                bd = ImageDraw.Draw(box)\n                bd.rectangle([0, 0, bw2, bh2], fill=ac + (255,))\n                bd.text((pad, bh2 // 2), cta, font=f,\n                        fill=ctx[\"pal\"][\"on_accent\"] + (255,), anchor=\"lm\")\n                ax = bw2 - 40\n                ay = bh2 // 2\n                bd.polygon([(ax, ay - 10), (ax + 18, ay), (ax, ay + 10)],\n                           fill=ctx[\"pal\"][\"on_accent\"] + (255,))\n                if sc2 != 1.0:\n                    box = box.resize((int(box.width * sc2), int(box.height * sc2)),\n                                     Image.BICUBIC)\n                im.alpha_composite(box, (c[\"M\"], min(H - c[\"foot\"] - box.height - 20,\n                                                     y + 40)))\n                d = ImageDraw.Draw(im, \"RGBA\")\n\n    else:\n        label(d, ctx, sc.get(\"label\") or \"\", p)\n        head = sc.get(\"headline1\") or \"\"\n        y = c[\"body_y\"] - 90\n        if head:\n            f = M.font(\"title\", int(c[\"s_head\"] * 0.72), head)\n            gg = M.ease(M.seg(p, 0.10, 0.36))\n            for ln in M.wrap(d, head, f, W - c[\"M\"] * 2):\n                if gg > 0:\n                    d.text((c[\"M\"], y + int((1 - gg) * 36)), ln, font=f,\n                           fill=CREAM + (int(255 * gg),))\n                y += int(c[\"s_head\"] * 0.84)\n            y += 22\n        body = [t for t in (sc.get(\"lines\") or []) if t]\n        if body:\n            lines_block(d, ctx, body, p, y, c[\"s_body\"], \"body\", 0.24)\n\n    ch = sc.get(\"char\") or \"\"\n    if ch and kind != \"logo\":\n        # MN_NEWSCARD_CHAR_LIFE_V1\n        gch = M.ease(M.seg(p, 0.30, 0.56))\n        if gch > 0:\n            size = int(W * 0.0945)   # MN_NEWSCARD_SIZE_V1 : 원래의 70%\n            base_state = sc.get(\"char_state\") or \"normal\"\n            st, ok, look, bob = char_life(base_state, p, idx, size)\n            x = W - c[\"M\"] - size\n            y = H - c[\"foot\"] - size - 24 + bob + int((1 - gch) * 40)\n            try:\n                C.paste(im, ch, size, (x, y), state=st, open_k=ok, look=look)\n                d = ImageDraw.Draw(im, \"RGBA\")\n            except Exception:\n                pass\n\n    progress(d, ctx, idx, total)\n    foot(d, ctx, sc)\n    im = wipe(im, p, ctx, idx, sc)\n    return im.convert(\"RGB\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    raw = \"\"\n    if len(sys.argv) > 1 and os.path.isfile(sys.argv[1]):\n        raw = open(sys.argv[1], encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\").read()\n    elif os.path.isfile(\"input.txt\"):\n        raw = open(\"input.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\").read()\n    raw = raw.strip()\n    if not raw:\n        print(\"[오류] 입력이 비었습니다. JSON 한 덩이를 주세요.\")\n        return\n    try:\n        d0 = json.loads(raw)\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(\"[오류] JSON 을 읽지 못했습니다: \" + repr(e))\n        return\n\n    if d0.get(\"skip\"):\n        print(\"[건너뜀] \" + (d0.get(\"skip_reason\") or \"이번에는 만들 것이 없습니다.\"))\n        return\n\n    scenes = d0.get(\"scenes\") or []\n    if not scenes:\n        print(\"[오류] scenes 가 비었습니다. 장면을 하나 이상 주세요.\")\n        return\n\n    log = []\n    d0, style_pal = apply_style(d0)   # MN_NEWSCARD_STYLE_NODE_V1\n    shape = (d0.get(\"shape\") or \"tall\").lower()\n    if shape not in M.SHAPES:\n        shape = \"tall\"\n    W = M.SHAPES[shape][\"w\"]\n    H = M.SHAPES[shape][\"h\"]\n    pal = style_pal or (M.PALETTES.get((d0.get(\"palette\") or \"lime\").lower())\n                        or M.PALETTES[\"lime\"])\n    if style_pal:\n        log.append(\"영상 스타일 노드의 색을 씁니다.\")\n    rnd = random.Random(int(d0.get(\"seed\") or 7))\n\n    fps = max(12, min(30, int(d0.get(\"fps\") or 20)))\n    per = float(d0.get(\"scene_seconds\") or 5.0)\n    per = max(2.0, min(12.0, per))\n\n    outdir = d0.get(\"out\") or os.path.join(M.out_root(), \"images\", \"cardnews\", \"story\")\n    if not os.path.isdir(outdir):\n        os.makedirs(outdir)\n\n    # MN_NEWSCARD_STORY_PHOTOS_V1 - 장면 수만큼 사진을 모은다\n    orient = \"portrait\" if H > W else \"square\"\n    scenes_n = len(scenes)\n    want = max(1, min(scenes_n, int(d0.get(\"photo_count\") or scenes_n)))\n\n    queries = []\n    for sc in scenes:\n        qq = (sc.get(\"photo_query\") or \"\").strip()\n        if qq and qq not in queries:\n            queries.append(qq)\n    main_q = (d0.get(\"photo_query\") or \"\").strip()\n    if main_q and main_q not in queries:\n        queries.insert(0, main_q)\n\n    photos = []\n    seen_paths = set()\n    for qq in (queries or [\"\"]):\n        if len(photos) >= want:\n            break\n        for _ in range(3):\n            if len(photos) >= want:\n                break\n            got = M.fetch_photo(qq, orient, log)\n            if not got or got[\"path\"] in seen_paths:\n                break\n            seen_paths.add(got[\"path\"])\n            photos.append(got)\n\n    bases = []\n    for ph in photos:\n        try:\n            bases.append(M.tone_fast(Image.open(ph[\"path\"]), pal, W, H))\n        except Exception as e:\n            log.append(\"사진 한 장을 못 썼습니다: \" + repr(e)[:90])\n    if not bases:\n        bases = [M.made_bg(W, H, pal, rnd)]\n        log.append(\"사진이 없어 코드로 그린 배경을 씁니다.\")\n    elif len(bases) < scenes_n:\n        log.append(\"사진 %d장을 %d장면에 나눠 씁니다.\" % (len(bases), scenes_n))\n\n    base = bases[0]\n    photo = photos[0] if photos else None\n    credit = \"\"\n\n    ctx = {\"W\": W, \"H\": H, \"pal\": pal, \"base\": base, \"bases\": bases,\n           \"c\": lay(shape, W, H), \"mood\": (d0.get(\"mood\") or \"\"),\n           \"transitions\": d0.get(\"transitions\") or None,\n           \"grid\": M.grid_layer(W, H, pal), \"credit_text\": credit,\n           \"source\": d0.get(\"source\") or \"\", \"dim\": float(d0.get(\"dim\") or 0.66)}\n\n    stamp = datetime.datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y%m%d_%H%M%S\")\n    tmp = os.path.join(outdir, \"_frames_\" + stamp)\n    os.makedirs(tmp)\n\n    total = len(scenes)\n    n = 0\n    cover = None\n    for idx, sc in enumerate(scenes):\n        secs = float(sc.get(\"seconds\") or per)\n        secs = max(1.5, min(12.0, secs))\n        cnt = int(fps * secs)\n        hold = 0.16\n        for i in range(cnt):\n            t = i / float(max(1, cnt - 1))\n            p = min(1.0, t / (1.0 - hold))\n            fr = draw_scene(sc, p, ctx, idx, total)\n            n += 1\n            fr.save(os.path.join(tmp, \"f_%05d.png\" % n))\n            if idx == 0 and i == cnt - 1:\n                cover = fr\n\n    cover_path = os.path.join(outdir, \"story_%s_%s_cover.png\" % (stamp, shape))\n    if cover is not None:\n        cover.save(cover_path)\n\n    mp4 = os.path.join(outdir, \"story_%s_%s.mp4\" % (stamp, shape))\n    made = False\n    dur = n / float(fps)\n    if os.path.isfile(M.FFMPEG):\n        cmd = [M.FFMPEG, \"-y\", \"-nostdin\", \"-hide_banner\", \"-loglevel\", \"error\",\n               \"-framerate\", str(fps), \"-i\", os.path.join(tmp, \"f_%05d.png\"),\n               \"-f\", \"lavfi\", \"-t\", (\"%.2f\" % dur),\n               \"-i\", \"anullsrc=channel_layout=stereo:sample_rate=44100\",\n               \"-shortest\",\n               \"-c:v\", \"libx264\", \"-profile:v\", \"high\", \"-pix_fmt\", \"yuv420p\",\n               \"-crf\", \"20\", \"-c:a\", \"aac\", \"-b:a\", \"64k\",\n               \"-movflags\", \"+faststart\", mp4]\n        try:\n            r = subprocess.run(cmd, capture_output=True, text=True, errors=\"replace\",\n                               timeout=900, stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL)\n            if r.returncode == 0 and os.path.isfile(mp4):\n                ok, why = M.check_video(mp4)\n                made = ok\n                log.append((\"검사 통과 - \" if ok else \"검사 미통과 - \") + why)\n            else:\n                log.append(\"ffmpeg 실패: \" + (r.stderr or \"\")[:300])\n        except Exception as e:\n            log.append(\"ffmpeg 실행 실패: \" + repr(e)[:200])\n    else:\n        log.append(\"ffmpeg 를 찾지 못했습니다: \" + M.FFMPEG)\n\n    if made:\n        try:\n            shutil.rmtree(tmp)\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n\n    if photos:\n        try:\n            with open(os.path.join(outdir, \"사진 출처.txt\"), \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n                for ph in photos:\n                    f.write(\"%s\\t%s\\t%s\\t%s\\t%s\\n\" % (\n                        stamp, os.path.basename(mp4), ph.get(\"site\", \"\"),\n                        ph.get(\"author\", \"\"), ph.get(\"link\", \"\")))\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n\n    print(\"모양: %s  %dx%d   장면 %d개 / %.1f초 / %dfps (%d장)\"\n          % (shape, W, H, total, dur, fps, n))\n    print(\"배경: \" + (\"사진 %d장 (%s)\" % (len(photos), photos[0].get(\"site\") or \"\")\n                    if photos else \"코드로 그린 배경\"))\n    if made:\n        print(\"영상: \" + mp4)\n    else:\n        print(\"영상: 만들지 못했습니다. 낱장은 여기 있습니다: \" + tmp)\n    print(\"커버: \" + cover_path)\n    for s in log:\n        print(\"  - \" + s)\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n", "scripts/_job.json": "{\"kicker\": \"ON-DEVICE\", \"kicker2\": \"AGENTS\", \"headline1\": \"A real agent,\", \"headline2\": \"not a demo\", \"standfirst\": \"Liquid AI shipped an agent that runs 75 tools locally\", \"big\": \"75\", \"big_line1\": \"tools - security scans,\", \"big_line2\": \"file ops, audit logs\", \"stamp\": \"NOTHING LEAVES\", \"source\": \"VIA THURSDAI\", \"issue\": \"NO. 001 - AUG 2026\", \"palette\": \"lime\", \"shape\": \"tall\", \"lang\": \"en\", \"seed\": 11, \"photo_query\": \"server room dark\", \"seconds\": 5, \"fps\": 20}", "scripts/_job_ko.json": "{\"kicker\": \"온디바이스\", \"kicker2\": \"에이전트\", \"headline1\": \"시연이 아니라\", \"headline2\": \"진짜 일꾼\", \"standfirst\": \"리퀴드AI가 도구 75개를 내 컴퓨터에서 다루는 에이전트를 내놓았다\", \"big\": \"75\", \"big_line1\": \"보안 점검, 파일 다루기,\", \"big_line2\": \"기록 남기기까지\", \"stamp\": \"밖으로 안 나간다\", \"source\": \"출처 THURSDAI\", \"issue\": \"1호 - 2026년 8월\", \"palette\": \"teal\", \"shape\": \"square\", \"lang\": \"ko\", \"seed\": 23, \"photo_query\": \"server room dark\", \"seconds\": 5, \"fps\": 20}", "scripts/_job_story.json": "{\"palette\": \"lime\", \"shape\": \"tall\", \"seed\": 31, \"fps\": 20, \"scene_seconds\": 5, \"source\": \"VIA THURSDAI\", \"out\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\fugus\\\\Documents\\\\MYNERD\\\\images\\\\cardnews\\\\story\", \"scenes\": [{\"type\": \"cover\", \"kicker\": \"ON-DEVICE\", \"kicker2\": \"AGENTS\", \"headline1\": \"A real agent,\", \"headline2\": \"not a demo\", \"standfirst\": \"Liquid AI put a working agent on the desktop.\", \"char\": \"trigi\", \"char_state\": \"happy\", \"photo_query\": \"server room dark\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"label\": \"WHAT HAPPENED\", \"headline1\": \"It runs on your own machine.\", \"lines\": [\"Liquid AI released an agent that calls 75 tools without sending anything to a server.\", \"Security scans, file operations and audit logs all stay on the device.\"], \"char\": \"nexi\", \"char_state\": \"normal\", \"photo_query\": \"laptop desk night\"}, {\"type\": \"number\", \"label\": \"THE NUMBER\", \"big\": \"75\", \"lines\": [\"tools the agent can call on its own\", \"no cloud round trip for any of them\"], \"char\": \"nodi\", \"char_state\": \"surprise\", \"photo_query\": \"circuit board macro\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"label\": \"WHY IT MATTERS\", \"headline1\": \"Local stops being the compromise.\", \"lines\": [\"Until now local meant slower and dumber. You traded capability for privacy.\", \"That trade is what just moved.\"], \"char\": \"loopi\", \"char_state\": \"work\", \"photo_query\": \"data center corridor\"}, {\"type\": \"quote\", \"label\": \"THE SHIFT\", \"text\": \"The question is no longer whether local can do it, but who is allowed to see the data while it does.\", \"photo_query\": \"dark concrete wall\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"label\": \"WHO THIS HITS\", \"headline1\": \"Regulated desks first.\", \"lines\": [\"Clinics, law firms and finance teams cannot send client files to a vendor.\", \"They have been waiting for exactly this.\"], \"char\": \"nexi\", \"char_state\": \"alert\", \"photo_query\": \"hospital corridor empty\"}, {\"type\": \"number\", \"label\": \"WHAT IT COSTS\", \"big\": \"0\", \"lines\": [\"requests leaving the building\", \"the machine you already own does the work\"], \"char\": \"nodi\", \"char_state\": \"happy\", \"photo_query\": \"network cables\"}, {\"type\": \"outro\", \"label\": \"MYNERD VIEW\", \"headline1\": \"Tools follow the data, not the other way around.\", \"lines\": [\"We build for people whose work cannot leave the room.\", \"That constraint is not a limitation. It is the whole product.\"], \"cta\": \"mynerd.io\", \"photo_query\": \"office window dusk\"}, {\"type\": \"logo\", \"headline1\": \"Built to stay put.\", \"lines\": [\"Local first, and still a full agent.\", \"That is the whole idea.\"], \"cta\": \"mynerd.io\", \"seconds\": 9}]}", "scripts/_job_story_narr.json": "{\n \"palette\": \"lime\",\n \"shape\": \"tall\",\n \"seed\": 31,\n \"fps\": 20,\n \"scene_seconds\": 5,\n \"source\": \"VIA THURSDAI\",\n \"out\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\fugus\\\\Documents\\\\MYNERD\\\\images\\\\cardnews\\\\story\",\n \"scenes\": [\n  {\n   \"type\": \"cover\",\n   \"kicker\": \"ON-DEVICE\",\n   \"kicker2\": \"AGENTS\",\n   \"headline1\": \"A real agent,\",\n   \"headline2\": \"not a demo\",\n   \"standfirst\": \"Liquid AI put a working agent on the desktop.\",\n   \"char\": \"trigi\",\n   \"char_state\": \"happy\",\n   \"photo_query\": \"server room dark\",\n   \"narration\": \"Liquid AI just put a real working agent on the desktop. Not a demo.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"type\": \"text\",\n   \"label\": \"WHAT HAPPENED\",\n   \"headline1\": \"It runs on your own machine.\",\n   \"lines\": [\n    \"Liquid AI released an agent that calls 75 tools without sending anything to a server.\",\n    \"Security scans, file operations and audit logs all stay on the device.\"\n   ],\n   \"char\": \"nexi\",\n   \"char_state\": \"normal\",\n   \"photo_query\": \"laptop desk night\",\n   \"narration\": \"It calls seventy five tools without sending anything to a server. Security scans, file work, audit logs. All of it stays on your machine.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"type\": \"number\",\n   \"label\": \"THE NUMBER\",\n   \"big\": \"75\",\n   \"lines\": [\n    \"tools the agent can call on its own\",\n    \"no cloud round trip for any of them\"\n   ],\n   \"char\": \"nodi\",\n   \"char_state\": \"surprise\",\n   \"photo_query\": \"circuit board macro\",\n   \"narration\": \"Seventy five tools. Not one of them needs a round trip to the cloud.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"type\": \"text\",\n   \"label\": \"WHY IT MATTERS\",\n   \"headline1\": \"Local stops being the compromise.\",\n   \"lines\": [\n    \"Until now local meant slower and dumber. You traded capability for privacy.\",\n    \"That trade is what just moved.\"\n   ],\n   \"char\": \"loopi\",\n   \"char_state\": \"work\",\n   \"photo_query\": \"data center corridor\",\n   \"narration\": \"Until now, local meant slower and dumber. You gave up capability to keep privacy. That trade is what just moved.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"type\": \"quote\",\n   \"label\": \"THE SHIFT\",\n   \"text\": \"The question is no longer whether local can do it, but who is allowed to see the data while it does.\",\n   \"photo_query\": \"dark concrete wall\",\n   \"narration\": \"The people who need this most are the ones who were never allowed to use cloud AI in the first place.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"type\": \"text\",\n   \"label\": \"WHO THIS HITS\",\n   \"headline1\": \"Regulated desks first.\",\n   \"lines\": [\n    \"Clinics, law firms and finance teams cannot send client files to a vendor.\",\n    \"They have been waiting for exactly this.\"\n   ],\n   \"char\": \"nexi\",\n   \"char_state\": \"alert\",\n   \"photo_query\": \"hospital corridor empty\",\n   \"narration\": \"Hospitals. Law firms. Banks. Anywhere the data is not allowed to leave the building.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"type\": \"number\",\n   \"label\": \"WHAT IT COSTS\",\n   \"big\": \"0\",\n   \"lines\": [\n    \"requests leaving the building\",\n    \"the machine you already own does the work\"\n   ],\n   \"char\": \"nodi\",\n   \"char_state\": \"happy\",\n   \"photo_query\": \"network cables\",\n   \"narration\": \"The interesting part is not the model. It is that the work now finishes where it starts.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"type\": \"outro\",\n   \"label\": \"MYNERD VIEW\",\n   \"headline1\": \"Tools follow the data, not the other way around.\",\n   \"lines\": [\n    \"We build for people whose work cannot leave the room.\",\n    \"That constraint is not a limitation. It is the whole product.\"\n   ],\n   \"cta\": \"mynerd.io\",\n   \"photo_query\": \"office window dusk\",\n   \"narration\": \"We build for exactly this. Local first, and cloud only when you choose it.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"type\": \"logo\",\n   \"headline1\": \"Built to stay put.\",\n   \"lines\": [\n    \"Local first, and still a full agent.\",\n    \"That is the whole idea.\"\n   ],\n   \"cta\": \"mynerd.io\",\n   \"seconds\": 9,\n   \"narration\": \"MYNERD. Your work stays yours.\"\n  }\n ],\n \"voice\": \"F1\",\n \"voice_lang\": \"en\"\n}", "scripts/_job_story_narr_ko.json": "{\n \"palette\": \"lime\",\n \"shape\": \"tall\",\n \"seed\": 31,\n \"fps\": 20,\n \"scene_seconds\": 5,\n \"source\": \"VIA THURSDAI\",\n \"out\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\fugus\\\\Documents\\\\MYNERD\\\\images\\\\cardnews\\\\story\",\n \"scenes\": [\n  {\n   \"type\": \"cover\",\n   \"kicker\": \"온디바이스\",\n   \"kicker2\": \"에이전트\",\n   \"headline1\": \"진짜 에이전트,\",\n   \"headline2\": \"시연이 아니라\",\n   \"standfirst\": \"리퀴드에이아이가 쓸 수 있는 에이전트를 데스크탑에 올렸다.\",\n   \"char\": \"trigi\",\n   \"char_state\": \"happy\",\n   \"photo_query\": \"server room dark\",\n   \"narration\": \"리퀴드에이아이가 진짜로 일하는 에이전트를 내 컴퓨터에 올렸습니다. 시연용이 아닙니다.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"type\": \"text\",\n   \"label\": \"무슨 일이\",\n   \"headline1\": \"내 컴퓨터 안에서 돕니다.\",\n   \"lines\": [\n    \"도구 일흔다섯 개를 서버에 아무것도 보내지 않고 직접 불러 씁니다.\",\n    \"보안 점검도, 파일 작업도, 기록도 전부 기기 안에 남습니다.\"\n   ],\n   \"char\": \"nexi\",\n   \"char_state\": \"normal\",\n   \"photo_query\": \"laptop desk night\",\n   \"narration\": \"도구 일흔다섯 개를 서버에 아무것도 보내지 않고 부릅니다. 보안 점검, 파일 작업, 기록. 전부 내 기기 안에 남습니다.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"type\": \"number\",\n   \"label\": \"숫자\",\n   \"big\": \"75\",\n   \"lines\": [\n    \"에이전트가 스스로 부르는 도구 수\",\n    \"그중 클라우드를 거치는 것은 하나도 없다\"\n   ],\n   \"char\": \"nodi\",\n   \"char_state\": \"surprise\",\n   \"photo_query\": \"circuit board macro\",\n   \"narration\": \"일흔다섯 개. 그중 클라우드를 다녀오는 것은 하나도 없습니다.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"type\": \"text\",\n   \"label\": \"왜 중요한가\",\n   \"headline1\": \"로컬이 더는 타협이 아닙니다.\",\n   \"lines\": [\n    \"지금까지 로컬은 느리고 덜 똑똑하다는 뜻이었습니다. 개인정보를 지키려면 성능을 내줘야 했죠.\",\n    \"그 맞바꿈이 방금 움직였습니다.\"\n   ],\n   \"char\": \"loopi\",\n   \"char_state\": \"work\",\n   \"photo_query\": \"data center corridor\",\n   \"narration\": \"지금까지 로컬은 느리고 덜 똑똑하다는 뜻이었습니다. 개인정보를 지키려면 성능을 내줘야 했죠. 그 맞바꿈이 방금 움직였습니다.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"type\": \"quote\",\n   \"label\": \"달라진 것\",\n   \"text\": \"이제 물음은 로컬이 할 수 있느냐가 아니라, 누가 그 자료를 볼 수 있느냐다.\",\n   \"photo_query\": \"dark concrete wall\",\n   \"narration\": \"이게 가장 필요한 사람들은, 애초에 클라우드 인공지능을 쓸 수 없었던 사람들입니다.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"type\": \"text\",\n   \"label\": \"누구에게 와닿나\",\n   \"headline1\": \"규제받는 자리부터.\",\n   \"lines\": [\n    \"병원과 법무법인, 금융팀은 고객 파일을 바깥 업체에 보낼 수 없습니다.\",\n    \"이들이 기다려 온 것이 바로 이것입니다.\"\n   ],\n   \"char\": \"nexi\",\n   \"char_state\": \"alert\",\n   \"photo_query\": \"hospital corridor empty\",\n   \"narration\": \"병원, 법무법인, 은행. 자료가 건물 밖으로 나갈 수 없는 곳들입니다.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"type\": \"number\",\n   \"label\": \"무엇이 드나\",\n   \"big\": \"0\",\n   \"lines\": [\n    \"건물 밖으로 나가는 요청 수\",\n    \"기기가 스스로 처리하는 일\"\n   ],\n   \"char\": \"nodi\",\n   \"char_state\": \"happy\",\n   \"photo_query\": \"network cables\",\n   \"narration\": \"흥미로운 건 모델이 아닙니다. 일이 시작한 자리에서 끝난다는 점입니다.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"type\": \"outro\",\n   \"label\": \"우리가 만드는 것\",\n   \"headline1\": \"로컬이 기본입니다.\",\n   \"lines\": [\n    \"MYNERD 는 처음부터 이 자리를 보고 만들었습니다.\",\n    \"클라우드는 쓰고 싶을 때만 붙입니다.\"\n   ],\n   \"cta\": \"mynerd.io\",\n   \"photo_query\": \"office window dusk\",\n   \"narration\": \"저희는 정확히 이걸 위해 만듭니다. 로컬이 기본, 클라우드는 고를 때만.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"type\": \"logo\",\n   \"headline1\": \"당신의 일은 당신의 것으로.\",\n   \"lines\": [\n    \"mynerd.io\"\n   ],\n   \"cta\": \"받아서 써 보세요\",\n   \"seconds\": 9,\n   \"narration\": \"마이너드. 당신의 일은 당신의 것으로.\"\n  }\n ],\n \"voice\": \"F1\",\n \"voice_lang\": \"ko\",\n \"lang\": \"ko\"\n}"}}}, "provider": {"official": true, "name": "MYNERD", "hash": "712fd489b44082d31d095fac05cd0195ceb508835d01ae1f65c46fc1a7b4fc7f", "sig": "d2a12a98da8c6a35ed7f3c274b3db9779a1f533e96bcb8bc221340791514001f"}}